<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Tara chet miuüa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tara chet miuüa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tara chet miuüa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tara chet Miuüa</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai; nachepaw risi Samuel naown kown mih sakowmra uowi, now rui khin dow 1,050-1,000 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh ruiah mih chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow Josua kowng kung hownia Samuel chowng mowr kowi kowh Israeluüa chowm krang uowi krang lawnguan arui uowi. Nami khin khe dow Israeluüa kowh mang uowi dowi tak. Amatni kowi kruitownah mih dow tara chet miuüa taih tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Israeluüa dow Thurai ana pek iawng Kanan pren kowi kowh akeng mih chenchapuüa kowi asaima prütta dowi. Amatni dow akeng chenchapuüa iawng tawi chang khai. Amatni dow akeng chenchap masiuüa hown tachawng khai, now naiawngün maru-uüa kowh arup kowi tawi chupiia khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru Israeluüa kowi naripah kownkow nowng chang miuüa rut kowi ap-ah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih angak hownia tarip hanow nowng chang miuüa rut hownia nalawngah kownkow Thurai tut-e awr kar büah khai. Nakhowk khe kowh amatni kowi nalawngah kownkow Thurai uang khowm bowk pe mih maru-uüa kowi dow tara chet miuüa pahai tek pe khai. Tara chet miuüa kowi dow kruitown miuüa pahai paw tek pe khai. Naiawngün tara chet miuüa dow chowlowkkow chen kowi lowk ia chi kruitown büah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tara chet miuüa hown aplan aplan Thurai uang lawngah chepaw Israeluüa dow plan plan chang ngak khai. Naiawng rakowi mami bowih hownia lusa maru mün khowt chow nga mih hai aiachow hown Thurai kowi tamata mih achima a-i khi.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Kramamu: Kramamu pami dow Thurai chintak mih chekhai. Kramamu kowi dow kuangsai maru pahai paw tek pe chekhai. Kramamu-uüa dow mukuang pren kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Klowngkrua dawngh: Klowngkrua dawngh pami dow klowng pre buk kruaah now klowngkra kowi ü-ah mih tawnguat chekhai. Klowngkrua dawngh mih pre sum chaing uowi; atowngchow mih chaing, khowt pat towng dowi mih chaing hai athawngma mih chaing uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Kawrngaramchük: Kawrngaramchük pami dow apowm kawrnga hown tatu ngia chekhai. Tawkche kawrngaramchük dow kawrnga iawng iowm lenma nadowi. Kawrngaramchük dow uanh kur müa kowi maru lang tawngah hu chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Kawrnga kari: Kawrnga kari pami dow alai kowh Israeluüa chowng khe kowh changla tasen müa mih kari chekhai. Naiawng mih kari dow kari khawk uowi tawkche kawrnga hown kowh küngah mih chaing taih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Israeluüa tawng chow own mih hai tawng chow naown kown mih 1:1-3:6</para>
  <para style="io1">Tara chet miuüa chowng 3:7-16:31</para>
  <para style="io2">Awtniel, Ehud hai Samgar 3:7-31</para>
  <para style="io2">Debawra hai Barak 4:1-5:31</para>
  <para style="io2">Gideawn hai Abimelek 6:1-9:57</para>
  <para style="io2">Tola hai Jair 10:1-5</para>
  <para style="io2">Jeftha 10:6-12:7</para>
  <para style="io2">Ibzan, Elawn hai Abdawn 12:8-15</para>
  <para style="io2">Simsawn 13:1-16:31</para>
  <para style="io1">Kawngmu, chowm krang uowi krang hai pren rirow piak mih 17:1-21:25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Ta sing uowi mih Kananuüa hown Israeluüa tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Josua kowng kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi Israeluüa lüntaah mih, “Kananuüa kowi nakowsen kownkow anging pungmadawng hownia mia iawng mih krungchakuüa chow narik tarü kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Juda krungchakuüa narik tarü kown; pren dow amatni rut kowi ang apta pe mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Nami laiklow tata hanow amatni kowh tainau Simiawn krungchakuüa kowi Juda krungchakuüa tek pe mih, “Anging kaah mih süng kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa hown nadowk tasen kownkow uang tawi khowng anging diah, now enni kaah mih süng kowi kowh uowi miuüa hown enni cham dowk tasen khe anging paw tawi khowng enni kown taih,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Simiawn krungchakuüa mih Juda krungchakuüa hown tawi tarü tasen khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Now Juda krungchakuüa kowdowk tasen now Kananuüa hai Perizuüa kowi mih amatni rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap pe khai. Judauüa mih maru iun 10,000 ia mowr Bezek marow kowi saita khai. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Nakhowk khe nakowi mih Bezek marow mang Adoni-Bezek kowi paw krumla büah khai, now aia kowi paw senah büah khai. Amatni dow Kananuüa hai Perizuüa kowi nowngta khai. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Tasenra hownia Adoni-Bezek powt khe amatni dow kowkawikrawiah now uang khümla khai, now aia kowh rutma hai khawkma ün tengta pe khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Nakhowk khe Adoni-Bezek tek mih, “Mang 70 ia kowh rutma hai khawkma ang tengta pe khai. Amatni dow ang <char style="w">pawitang</char> hownia kowh hawk mih hawm ma kan ma krawi lümah now cha büah khai. Amatni kowi kowh ang changah iawng Thurai paw kawmat chang ang mih chekhai,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow Bezek marow mang kowi mih Jerusalem marow kowi kowpawla khai, now nakowi mih Bezek marow mang dow kowng khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Juda krungchakuüa dow Jerusalem marow mih kowsenah hanow kowpowngta khai. Amatni dow marowchakuüa kowi saita bowk hanow marow mih towkta pe khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih hungma mawngma süng, Negeb hai awkaw süng kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi nakowsen kownkow tarü khai. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Amatni dow Hebrawn kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi kowsenah hanow Sesai, Ahiman hai Talmai pami marow kowi kownowngta büah khai. Hebrawn marow kowh ming auown khe dow Kiriat-Arba chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Hebrawn marow hownia amatni mih Debir marow kowi kowdowk tasen kownkow tarü büah khai. Debir marow kowh ming auown khe dow Kiriat-Sefer chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa kowi Kaleb tek pe mih, “Kownowng powng Kiriat-Sefer marow mih maru kowi dow ang kowh chama Aksa hown ang pe tachawngah kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Now Kaleb kowh tainau Kenaz chapa Awtniel mih Kiriat-Sefer marow kowpowngta khai. Naiawng rakowi Kaleb mih achama Aksa kowi Awtniel hown pe tachawngah khai. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Ahua tut-e tawi mang kung kowi a-pa hownia nalüla krawng parah kownkow Aksa kowi ahua chükah khai. Now nami lawnguan kowi nakowtalawp kownkow Aksa mih a-pa tut-e kowkowi khai. Kawrngaramchük hownia Aksa iu dowm khe a-pa Kaleb lüntaah mih, “Tum, tawng chow en nau?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Nakhowk khe Aksa tek pe a-pa mih, “Apa, ang nau mih uowi pachap tak. Süngrüp süngkangma dow en peta ang khowk. Tawkche nakowi dow tui uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown pela ang tuikuam ne diah,” pape khai. Nahanow Aluk kowi kowh tuikuam hai Adak kowi kowh tuikuam mih Aksa kowi Kaleb peah khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Kenuüa dow Judauüa hown Jeriko marow — Chekmarawng singh marow — hownia uang lawt khai, now amatni dow Arad marow mrawkphak pra kowh Juda süng kowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowi khai. Nakowi kowh maru-uüa hown amatni dow kowtawi uowi khai. Kenuüa dow Mosi pu kowh krungchakuüa chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Juda krungchakuüa dow amatni kowh tainau Simiawn krungchakuüa hown kowkowiah now Zefat marow kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi kowsenah khai, now amatni kowh marow mih asaima piakla pe khai. Naiawng rakowi nami marow ming dow Hawrma pahai chap pe khai. (Hawrma pami dow “Piakra” pami chekhai). <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Juda krungchakuüa dow Gaza marow, Askelawn marow, Ekrawn marow hai naiawngün riaret kowi kowh uowi mih süng maten powngta büah bowk khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />CHAKRAMANG dow Juda krungchakuüa tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Amatni dow hungma mawngma süng mih krawi powngta khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw dowm kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi dow nowng prüt büah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi uowi miuüa kowh dow lawngha hown kowh <char style="w">kawrnga kari</char> uowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Now Mosi laikham uowi iawng Kaleb kowi dow Hebrawn marow mih peah khai. Nami Hebrawn marow hownia dow Anak kowh chapa sum ia kowi Kaleb prütta khai. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Nachenganchepaw Benjamin krungchakuüa dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi mih Jebusuüa kowi nowng prütta dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Jebusuüa dow kawmat mowr paw Benjamin krungchakuüa hown tawi taiua uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Josef krungchakuüa dow Bethel marow kowi kowsenah khai. CHAKRAMANG dow amatni tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Amatni dow marow mih kowrik müah kaneu kownkow kowrik chin maru ne khai. Bethel marow ming auown khe dow Luz chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Nami kowrik mü marow mih maru-uüa dow Bethel marow hownia maru uang lawt lowk ia mih khi büah khai. Now amatni dow nami maru kowi tek pe mih, “Marow kowi nakupla kown mih tiama tüng anging dit. En che tüng anging now tawngpaw anging nachang en kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Nami maru tüng pe tiama now amatni dow marow lak kowi kowkup khai bowt, now marow maten kowi kowh maru kowi krawi sai büah khai. Nachenganchepaw nami maru hai aia krungchakuüa kowi dow saila büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru mih Hituüa pren kowi kowkowi hanow kowthawp marow lowk khai, now nami marow ming dow Luz pahai aia chap pe khai. Kawmat mowr paw nami marow ming dow naiawng chowreng tak chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Manase krungchakuüa dow Bet-San marow, Tanak marow, Dawr marow, Ibleam marow, Megido marow hai naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua kowi uowi mih maru-uüa kowi nowng prüt büah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün kua hai marow kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa dow naiawngün hownia napowt dowi kownkow tatang chen chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow Israeluüa prütta bowk dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa uang kür kung kowi amatni kowi mih kür hown changla nar khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Efraim krungchakuüa paw Gezer marow kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi prütta bowk dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Kananuüa dow nakowi kowh Efraimuüa hown tawi hing uowi khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Zebulun krungchakuüa paw Kitarawn hai Nahalal marow kowi kowh Kananuüa kowi prütta dowi chekhai. Amatni dow naiawngün marow kowi kowh Kananuüa tut-e tawi hing uowi khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow kür hown Kananuüa kowi changla nar khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31-32" />Aser krungchakuüa paw Ako, Sidawn, Alab, Akzib, Helba, Afik hai Rehawb marow kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi prütta bowk dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow naiawngün marow kowi kowh Kananuüa pungmadawng kowi tawi hing uowi khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:31-32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Naptali krungchakuüa paw Bet-Semes hai Bet-Anat marow kowi kowh uowi mih Kananuüa kowi prütta bowk dowi chekhai. Amatni dow naiawngün marow kowi kowh Kananuüa pungmadawng kowi tawi hing uowi khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow naiawngün Kananuüa kowi kür hown changla nar khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Dan krungchakuüa kowi dow hungma mawngma süng kowi kür hown Amawruüa pe uowiah khai; amatni kowi dow dowm kowi Amawruüa pe uangah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Amawruüa dow Aijalawn marow hai Salbim marow, now Heres hungh kowi nauowi kownkow tatang chen khai. Nachenganchepaw Josef krungchakuüa uang kür kung kowi kür hown amatni kowi Josef krungchakuüa changla nar khai. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Amawruüa kowh süng dow Akrabim pami pangchowng hownia Sela marow iawng awr pün ngamlam khai.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Bokim kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu uang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu dow Gilgal pami arah hownia Bokim pami arah kowi uangah hanow tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni khai. Now enni pipu-uüa tut-e ang khamah mih pren kowi ang uang pawla enni khai. Ang tek enni mih, ‘Enni hown kowh ang towah mih sangbowk laitawm katpaw ang napiakta kown nadowi. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Mami prenchakuüa hown enni natatow sangbowk laitawm kown nadowi; amatni kowh phuchuara ün enni napiakta pe kown,’ pakhai. Tawkchedow ang laiklow enni chün dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng enni tuk chang khai? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Naiawng rakowi mami maru-uüa kowi enni pur hownia ang naprütta enni kown nadowk pami kawmat ang tek enni khowk. Amatni dow enni kow kowi chuh hown kowh takru mih iawng naown kown, now amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi enni tawi chupiia mih dow leng kowi kowh tasowk iawng naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Maiawngün laiklow Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh <char style="w">kramamu</char> tek pe kung kowi amatni dow atün atünma kar büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Bokim pahai chap pe khai. (Bokim pami dow “Kar rah” pami chekhai). Amatni dow nami arah re-e CHAKRAMANG vüi tawncher hown chang phuchua khai.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josua kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa kowi Josua pe mangta khai bowt. Now amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow kaah mih krawng bawn napowng kownkow mang büah khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Josua sing uowi mowr dow Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia büah khai. Now Josua kowng kung kowi paw lawngtang aluchowuüa sing uowi mowr dow maru kawmuüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia reng tak chekhai. Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG chang pe mih maten khi miuüa chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Josua dow 110 ning singla now kowng khai bowt. Josua dow Nun kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Now maru kawmuüa dow aia kowh uak mih Timnat-Sera marow kowi kowh aia kowh krawng bawn kowi dupah khai. Nami marow dow Efraim krungchakuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh Gas hungh tawngphak prakowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chün lai dowi rakowi Israeluüa ka ripra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Josua chowng kowi kowh maru kowng bowk kung kowi awr ta iuksown mih Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi tuk dowi chekhai. Now Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG chang pe mih paw tawi tuk büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang büah khai. Amatni dow Baal pami thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Amatni dow Aigupta pren hownia amatni kowi kowh uang lawtla mih CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi nuata büah khai. Amatni dow amatni riaret kowi kowh akeng mih chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa kung kowi cham tawi krawi büah khai, now cham tawi chupiia büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau khai. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nuata hanow Baal hai Astarte pami thuraiuüa kowi cham tawi chupiia büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa luk kowi kunmarauah khai. Amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa rut kowi aia ap-ah khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow amatni kowi pawla pe dawngthawnguan khai. Amatni kowi dow amatni riaret kowi kowh ransu-uüa rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap-ah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow ransu-uüa pur kowi nowng iowng dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Israeluüa cham dowk tasen towng CHAKRAMANG mih aia tekta khowk iawng amatni kowi krawi kingküaah reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow ransu-uüa kowi mapaw nowng büah dowi chekhai. Now amatni luk kowi dow phih kraingma chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa vüi CHAKRAMANG tow pe tara chet miuüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG mih amatni vüi tow pe aluchowuüa reng chekhai. Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow tara chet miuüa chekhai. Naiawngün tara chet miuüa dow ransu-uüa rut hownia Israeluüa kowi lawngah reng chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa dow naiawngün tara chet miuüa kowh laiklow sünta büah dowi. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm dowi iawng akeng mih thuraiuüa kung cham tawi krawi hanow cham tawi chupiia büah khai. Amatni kowh pipu-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek chün reng chowdiah. Tawkche kawmat kowh Israeluüa dow naiawngün ana pek lenlenma tamata büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Israeluüa vüi CHAKRAMANG tow pe mih tara chet miuüa tut-e dow aia tawi uowi reng chekhai. Naiawngün tara chet miuüa sing uowi mowr ransu-uüa rut hownia Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG lawngah reng chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ransu-uüa rut kowi Israeluüa kham ngare hai kawmkrat mih khin khe naiawngün tara chet miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr kar reng chekhai. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi plan saksing sanaah reng chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün tara chet miuüa kowng kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa mih amatni pipu-uüa lak-e lang suiiai kaniai mih tiama kowi plan mang büah khai. Amatni dow akeng mih thuraiuüa kung plan krawi büah khai, akeng mih thuraiuüa kowi tabawk krawm se tawi chupiia büah khai. Amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang angakma mih hai lai üa kürma mih dow mapaw hing towta büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa luk kowi kunmarauah khai. Aia tek mih, “Maiawngün maru-uüa dow amatni pipu-uüa hown kowh ang towah mih sangbowk laitawm chün dowi, now ang kowh ana pek paw sünta büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />Naiawng rakowi Josua kowng khe pren kowi kowh ta uowi ne tak mih akeng chenchapuüa kowi Israeluüa pur hownia ang naprütta pe kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Amatni kowi dow naiawngün chenchapuüa ang tawngah hanow ang nachaingah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni pipu-uüa iawng kawmat kowh Israeluüa mih ang tiama kowi namang tak chünchü pami ang tuk kown nau kowh chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi pren kowi towta hüah khai; aia dow Josua rut kowi paw apta dowi chekhai, now pren hownia paw amaisang prütta bowk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Akeng chenchapuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG towah reng tak mih auan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1-2" />Katpaw tasen dowi tak mih Israeluüa maten kowi nape tasenah hanow nape tukah tasen kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih Kanan pren kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa kowi prütta bowk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />CHAKRAMANG towah mih chenchapuüa dow Filistinuüa hai amatni kowh kruitown mih tanga ia, Sidawnuüa, Hivuüa hai Kananuüa maten chekhai. Hivuüa uowi mih dow Lebanawn hungma mawngma süng kowi, Bal-Hermawn hownia Lebo-Hamat mowr chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Amatni pipu-uüa kowi mih CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek Mosi peah khai. Naiawngün ana pek Israeluüa chün tak chünchü pami nachaingah kownkow naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tow pe mih chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow Kananuüa, Hituüa, Amawruüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uowi khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Israeluüa dow amatni chapauüa vüi naiawngün chenchapuüa kowh chamauüa kowi paw pe khai, now amatni kowh chamauüa kowi paw naiawngün chenchapuüa kowh chapauüa kowi pe pawah khai. Nami klen kowi amatni dow naiawngün chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi paw tawi chupiia büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Awtniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi tamata now Baal thuraiuüa kowi hai Asera limpu kowi cham tawi chupiia büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai. Now aia dow Israeluüa kowi Mesawpawtamia pren mang Kusan-Risathaim rut kowi apah khai. Amatni dow raiat ning mowr nami mang nimkrüa kowi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Nami kung kowi Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e nguk büah kar büah khai. Nahanow amatni kowi nalawngah kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih Awtniel kowi uang khowm pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla mih aia kowi uang peah kür khai, now aia dow Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih uang chowng khai. Aia cham dowk tasen khe Mesawpawtamia pren mang Kusan-Risathaim kowi dow aia rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap pe khai, now aia dow nami mang kowi nowngta khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Kenaz kowh chapa Awtniel kowng dowi mowr dow 40 ning mowr pren mih thaulangma chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Ehud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup ta plan chang khai iawk. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi nakingküaah kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih Moabuüa kowh mang Eglawn kowi pe kürah khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Eglawn mih Amawnuüa hai Amalekuüa kowi pawla now Israeluüa kowi senah khai bowt, now Israeluüa uowi rah Jeriko marow mih powngta pe khai. Nami marow ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Chekmarawng singh marow chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Israeluüa mih 18 ning mowr Moabuüa kowh mang Eglawn nimkrüa kowi uowi khai.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e nguk büah kar büah khai iawk. Now amatni kowi nalawngah kownkow Ehud kowi CHAKRAMANG uang khowm pe khai. Ehud dow Benjamin krungchak Gera kowh chapa chekhai. Aia dow lakuai rut hown chang lup mih maru chekhai. Moab pren mang Eglawn tut-e nakowsa <char style="w">mangmu</char> kownkow aia kowi dow Israeluüa kowchinah khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Now aia dow bürdawng saichow aklang amuk mih thawpah lowk khai. Now aia tarü mangmu sak khe nami saichow mih uan krüa kowi aia kowh hawmlawm thung kowi tapla now pawla khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Aia dow kowkowiah now Moabuüa kowh mang Eglawn kowi nami mangmu kowpeah khai. Mang Eglawn dow lainowmma kau chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ki peta mangmu kung kowi uang tawi sa mangmu miuüa hown Ehud mih mang khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Tawkche Gilgal re-e kowh hua hown kowh arup uowi rah mowr kowtawi mang hanow aia mih mang tut-e uang plan uang khai iawk. Now mang kowi uang tek pe mih, “Mangkri ow, ang tut-e kukpa natek en kown mih satang uowi lowk,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Nakhowk khe aia naruüa kowi mang tek pe mih, “Cham lawt büa diah,” pakhai. Now aia kowh naruüa dow nami hownia cham lawt bowk khai.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Nakhowk khe mang mih aia malowkchow kimluk kowi kowh li iowr rah towklak kowi chowm phülü khai. Mang re-e Ehud kowtatawnah now tek pe mih, “Ang tut-e naphowng en kown mih satang uowi lowk; nami satang dow Thurai hownia kowh uang ting mih chekhai,” pape khai. Nami laiklow tata now mang dow awr iowng khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Nakhowk khe Ehud mih aia lakuai rut hown aia hawmlawm thung kowi kowh saichow howkah now mang mu kowi haisawtah khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Nami saichow dow apung hailawm mu lak kowi kup now asau hown tamum khai; nami saichow dow Ehud plan howkah dowi bowt chekhai. Nami saichow dow mang kumlawng prakowi uang towk dit chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Nami kung kowi dow Ehud mih uang lawtah hanow kimbüng büngta now rowpkleb hown kliata khai.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehud powt kung kowi dow mang kowh naruüa uang now kimluk kowi kowh kimbüng akliama mih uang khita khai. Nakhowk khe amatni tatek mih, “Kim lak kowi kowh towklak kowi mangkri uat mih tangtang,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Amatni dow akrama chawngah khai. Nachenganchepaw mangkri uai ho kimbüng dowi reng rakowi uang pawla pe sabit büah now hoah büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow amatni kowh mangkri kowng kowh krawng kowi takuak hüah mih khi büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Anaruüa mih mang kowi chawngah reng tak khe Ehud dow powt kowh hua hown kowh arup uowi rah klenla now Seira kowi kowting tüng khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Nakowi mih Efraimuüa uowiah mih hungma mawngma süng kowi aia dow tum <char style="w">baw</char> khai, now Israeluüa mih aia hown hungh hownia adak kowi uang dowm hanow aia kung kowi tawi krawi khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi Ehud peah ana mih, “Enni kowh ransu Moabuüa kowi enni rut kowi CHAKRAMANG apta enni khowk. Naiawng rakowi ang kung kowi uang krawi büa diah,” pakhai. Nahanow amatni dow Ehud kung kowi tawi krawi tawi krawi now Moab pren re-e kowh Jawrdan aw khawk hown nowng pownah mowr mih arah maten krawi powngta bowk büah khai. Amatni dow naiawngün arah hownia mia iawng mih kowi paw pe pownah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Nami khin khe amatni dow Moabuüa 10,000 ia kowi saita khai. Naiawngün Moabuüa dow kow iungma hai akürma kangowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow lowk iachow paw ia powt büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Nami ni khe Moab pren dow Israeluüa powngta khai bowt. Nami ni hownia now 80 ning mowr pren mih athaulangma chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Samgar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Ehud kung kowi dow Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Samgar chekhai. Samgar dow Anat kowh chapa chekhai. Aia dow thingla chia mih müa hown Filistinuüa 600 ia kowi saita khai. Aia paw Israeluüa kowi lawngah khai.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s1">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Debawra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ehud kowng kung kowi Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup ta plan chang khai iawk. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi Kanan pren mang Jabin rut kowi ap-ah khai. Jabin chowm mang mih dow Hazawr marow kowi chekhai. Aia kowh siphai aluchow dow Sisera chekhai. Sisera uowi mih dow Harawset-Hakawim pami arah kowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Siphai aluchow Sisera kowh dow lawngha hown kowh kawrnga kari uowi 900 klüng chekhai. Aia dow pirmi ning mowr mih Israeluüa kowi lainowmma changah anowng apowng khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar se awr lü khowng khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Nami khin khe Lipidawt kowh masi Debawra pami masiuüa <char style="w">risi</char> uowi lowk ia. Aia dow Israeluüa kowh tara chet miia chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debawra dow aia kowh chekmarawng singh tut kowi chowm reng chekhai. Now Israeluüa mih amatni takhowk taran hanow nachet pe tara kownkow aia tut-e uang reng chekhai. Nami chekmarawng singh uowi mih dow Efraim krungchak kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh Rama hai Bethel takra kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Akat khe aia dow kowchin maru hanow Naptali pren kowi kowh Kades marow kowi uowi mih Barak kowi uang hawla khai. Barak dow Abinoam kowh chapa chekhai. Aia tek pe Barak mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai pe en ana mih maiawng: Naptali hai Zebulun krungchak hownia paw maru iun 10,000 ia diah. Now amatni kowi Tabawr hungh prakowi kowpawla diah. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Mang Jabin kowh siphai aluchow Sisera kowi aia kowh siphai hawmh hai aia kowh lawngha hown kowh kawrnga kari hailawm Kisawn aw re-e ang nauang pawla en kown. Now amatni kowi mih en rut kowi ang naap-ah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Nakhowk khe Barak tek pe Debawra mih, “Ang hown che en tawi now ang kowkowi kown. Nadowi now ang kowkowi dowi tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debawra tek pe mih, “Ow, ang tawi sow. Tawkchedow nami tasen awng mih kowi kowh kiowrira en naka kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih Sisera kowi masiuüa lowk ia rut kowi naap-ah kown chekhai,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow Debawra mih Barak hown Kades marow kowi kowtawi khai. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Now nakowi mih Zebulun krungchakuüa hai Naptali krungchakuüa pungmadawng hownia maru iun 10,000 ia Barak hawah khai. Nahanow aia dow naiawngün maru kawmuüa hown tarü khai bowt, now Debawra paw Barak tut-e tawi khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Nami khin khe Zananim pami arah kowi kowh sasua singh re-e khup tangbung mih Heber pami maru uowi lowk ia. Nami arah dow Kades marow hown atawnchow chekhai. Heber dow Ken chenchap chekhai. Aia dow amasi Jael hown amatni Ken chenchapuüa hownia lang uowi khai. Kenuüa dow Mosi kowh pu Hobab hown pachen sang chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12-13" />Sisera mih Tabawr hungh kowi Abinoam kowh chapa Barak kowkowi mih satang tata khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh 900 klüng mih lawngha hown kowh kawrnga kari hai aia kowh siphai hawmh kowi kuaah khai. Now aia dow naiawngünuüa hown Haroset-Hakoim hownia Kisawn aw pang kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Nakhowk khe Debawra tek pe Barak mih, “Tarü diah! Ani dow CHAKRAMANG mih en rut kowi Sisera kowi apta mih chowbowt. CHAKRAMANG mih en pur kowi rik mang khowk,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Barak dow pawla maru iun 10,000 ia now Tabawr hungh hownia iu dowm khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Now Barak dow aia kowh siphai hawmh hown Sisera kowi uang dowkah tasen khai. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG mih Sisera hailawm aia kowh kawrnga kari maten hai siphai hawmh maten kowi peah takrow takraira khai. Now Sisera dow aia kowh kawrnga kari hownia iu dowm hanow cham powt khai. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Nachenganchepaw Sisera kowh lawngha hown kowh kawrnga kari hai siphai hawmh kowi dow Haroset-Hakoim mowr Barak kawikrawiah khai. Now siphai hawmh maten kowi dow aia saita pe bowk khai; lowk iachow kowi paw aia pe plaiah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Tawkche Sisera dow iowm se Ken chenchap Heber kowh masi Jael kowh tangbung re-e kowpowt khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Hazawr marow mang Jabin dow Heber krungchakuüa hown auiua sinma chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Jael dow Sisera kowi khita hanow tangbung hownia uang lawt khai. Now tek pe aia mih, “Chakramang, tangbung lak kowi uang kup bowt. Kaah kram dowi,” pakhai. Nahanow Sisera dow tangbung lak kowi kowkup hanow mawk khai. Now aia kowi dow uanma hown Jael mih mumta khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisera tek pe Jael mih, “Ang tui sakkrai khai. Sakrauma hown pe kham ang tui ditchow dit,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Jael mih chak pik hown kowh iawn tui towk rah im ho pe hanow aia kowi pe khamah iawn tui khai. Now aia kowi dow uanma hown plan mumah khai iawk. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Nami kung kowi Sisera plan tek pe Jael mih, “Tangbung plawt kowi kowhawt iowng diah. Now ‘Alak kowi mia chow uowi?’ padow maru nauang lünta en chepaw naia kown. Nami khin khe ‘Miapaw uowi dowi’ padow hawt tek pe diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Sisera dow bowm lai rakowi hing amüi khai. Nakhowk khe Jael mih tangbung tük müa chung hai matul pawah khai. Now aia dow salow salowchow Sisera re-e kowkowi khai. Now nami chung dow Sisera kaubeng kowi Jael iu tak pe khai. Nami dow kaubeng mapra dam hownia krawng kowi taplawn pluk khai. Nahanow Sisera dow kowng khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Barak dow nakrawi cham Sisera kownkow Jael kowh tangbung re-e uang khai. Now Jael dow Barak kowi khita hanow tangbung hownia uang lawt khai. Now tek pe aia mih, “Alak kowi uang kup diah! En krawi chamah mih maru kowi ang tüng en sow,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Barak dow alak kowi kowkup khai. Now Sisera uak takuak hüah mih hai aia kaubeng kowi tangbung tük müa chung tatak hüah mih aia kowkhi khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Nami ni khe CHAKRAMANG mih Kanan pren mang Jabin kowi Israeluüa tut-e pe sumah khai. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih uang kür ngamlam hanow nami mang kowi hing piakta büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kanan pren mang kowi nowngta mih ni khe kowh meng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Nami ni khe Debawra hai Abinoam kowh chapa Barak iüah maiawng tek meng khai:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />“Israel aluchowuüa dow tasenra kowi maru kawmuüa kowi kruitownah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">now maru kawmuüa mih amatni sak nau hown tawi tarü tasen khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:2">CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Aw manguüa, sünta büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">aw kruitown miuüa, pe ching büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">CHAKRAMANG vüi ang natek meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai vüi kiow meng ang natek kown.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, Seir hungh hownia en tarowng mang khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">Edawm pren hownia en uang lawt khe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">lusa dow chür nukluk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">mukuang kowi kowh uangnim hownia tui uang takhük plawtlawt khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />CHAKRAMANG pur kowi dow hungh ün chürla kluk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai pur kowi dow Sinai hungh chür nukluk khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />“Anat kowh chapa Samgar chowng khe hai Jael chowng khe tiama chung iawng miapaw uam mang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:6">Cham kowi khari miuüa khowm padow akeng tiama chah iawng cham ria bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Ang Debawra mih Israeluüa tut-e uang uowi dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">amatni kowh u iawng ang chowng dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:7">Israeluüa kowh kua kowi miapaw uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">now amatni kowh kua dow akhaw aklaima chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />“Amatni dow akeng thuraiuüa prakowi cham pe ching büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">Nakhowk khe dow amatni kowh <char style="w">tapplawt</char> re-e tasen phaw khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">Israeluüa 40,000 ia rut kowi <char style="w">kawngma</char> lowkchow khowm uowi dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">amatni rut kowi dow reh lowkchow khowm uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Ang kowh sak dow Israel aluchowuüa maten tut-e chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">ang kowh sak dow amatni sak nau hown cham dowk tasen miuüa tut-e chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:9">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiowah büa diah!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Kawrngaramchükma klangiungma mih luk kowi kowh chowm miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">kawrngaramchükma luk kowi kowh asung khakma mih uan dau luk kowi chowm miuüa hai khawk hown kowh mang miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">enni mih maiawngün lawnguan srui kowi tek meng büa diah.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Tuikuam re-e kowh tünteu chang miuüa kowh klow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">amatni dow CHAKRAMANG awng mih lawnguan tatek khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Tünteu chang miuüa kowh how klow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">amatni dow Israeluüa awng mih laiklow tatek khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Naiawngün tata hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa dow kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">amatni dow marow tapplawt re-e kowkowi büa khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />“Rü diah, Debawra rü diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Rü diah, rü diah, chu i tek meng diah sik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Abinoam kowh chapa Barak, rü diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">A-i kowh ransu-uüa kowi khümla diah.<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />“Ta sing uowi miuüa dow siphai aluchowuüa tut-e uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa dow uang tarü tasen khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Tawngbak miuüa dow Amalekuüa uowi rah kowi kowh Efraimuüa süng hownia uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">amatni dow Benjamin krungchakuüa kung kowi uang krawi uang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Makir hownia dow siphai aluchowuüa uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">Zebulun hownia dow pren kruitown miuüa uang khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Isakar kowh aluchowuüa dow Debawra hown tawi tarü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">Isakar kowh maru-uüa dow iowm se iowm se <char style="w">lawngrawi</char> kowi kowdowm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">now amatni dow Barak kung kowi tawi krawi büah ruirui khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Nachenganchepaw Reuben krungchakuüa dow uang tawi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />“Aw Reuben krungchakuüa, tawngplawng kowchow ruapur tung takra kowi enni chowm phülü?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">Ruapur thing miuüa kowh prui tün enni sünta kown nau mih bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Reuben krungchakuüa dow takrüp tangi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">amatni dow tawng chow chang kown mih tuk büah dowi.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Gilead kowi kowh maru-uüa dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi ta uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">tawngplawng kowchow Dan krungchakuüa dow <char style="w">chawnlawng</char> kowi ta uowi khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Aser krungchakuüa dow sata pang kowi ta uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">amatni dow chawnlawng naira re-e ta uowi khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Nachenganchepaw Zebulun krungchakuüa dow singsing kowngkowng tawi dowk tasen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:18">Naptali krungchakuüa paw singsing kowngkowng tasenra kowi maru dowi rawn rik khüa khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />“Kananuüa kowh manguüa dow uang dowk tasen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">amatni dow Megido aw re-e kowh Tanak kowi uang tasen khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">Nachenganchepaw tai paiunchow paw ia rupla büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Mukuang hownia krek ün paw tawi dowk tasen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:20">amatni dow amatni uowi rah hownia Sisera kowi senah khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Ransu-uüa kowi dow alai kowh Kisawn aw nawmla bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">Aw ang kowh sak, sakkraingma hown pur prakowi mang ngamlam diah.<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />“Nami kung kowi dow kawrnga khawk chawp tün nowk rumrum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">akürma kangowh mih kawrnga hawmh dow alenma iowm khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek mih, ‘Merawz marow kowi peah piati diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi lainowmma peah piati diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi tawi khowngah tasen dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">amatni dow akürma mih ransu-uüa kowi tawi sen dowi chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />“Ken chenchap Heber kowh masi Jael dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">tangbung kowi uowi mih masiuüa pungmadawng kowi aia dow prasira lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisera lü tui khe aia dow uang pawla pe iawn tui khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">bia klangiungma mih hown aia dow uang pawla pe iawn tui bawi khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Akung kowi dow lakuai rut hown uang pawla tangbung tük müa chungh lowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">now hawmlawm rut hown dow uang dowkla matul lowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">Aia dow Sisera kaubeng kowi nami tangbung tük müa chungh takta pe pit khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">now aia dow Sisera kowh lu teuta pe iawm khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisera dow Jael khawk re-e hing takuak hüah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">aia dow nami re-e hing kowng khai.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />“Sisera kowi dow tawngpawk hownia a-u hawt tang müah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">aia dow tawngpawk kowi downg klawlaw se atünma tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Tawngplawng kowchow kawrnga kari uang plan mih kra lai kowbow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">Aia kowh kawrnga kari khawk tün ta dowi reng kowbow?’ pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Aia kowi dow prengia uowima mih auiuauüa klangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:29">nami powm iawng aia paw sakdawng hownia tawi tek mih,<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‘Cham rupah mih uanh kowbüah cham ka tangtang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">amatni pungmadawng kowi taret uanh büah mih naown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Kachakuüa lowk ia kowi masiuüa lowk ia downow pre ia chi naown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Sisera vüi dow asing asüama mih tawnguat naown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">now ang vüi dow sawt pe pau mih tawnguat naown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Ngawng tapat lut klangiungma sawt pe pau mih tawnguat cham ka büah dowi tham pabow?’ pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ransu-uüa Sisera iawng pacham piak bowk lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">Nachenganchepaw sakrau en miuüa dow sat iawng pacham kür reng lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Nami kung kowi dow pren mih 40 ning mowr athaulangma chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Midianuüa changah anowng apowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Akung kowi dow Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup ta plan chang khai iawk. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi ranit ning mowr Midianuüa nimkrüa kowi pe uowiah khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Now Midianuüa dow Israeluüa kowi lainowmma changah anowng apowng khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih puk kowi hai akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi ün cham tapet khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Israeluüa sawt liu mih khin khe Midianuüa, Amalekuüa hai Satlawt pra kowh pren hownia maru-uüa uangah hanow Israeluüa kowi uang senah reng chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Amatni dow Israeluüa uowi rah kowi uang krawi khup tangbung khai, now Israeluüa kowh luprak srui Gaza marow mowr piakta pe büah khai. Now chia, rua hai ruapur paw pawta pe bowk büah khai. Naiawng hai Israeluüa kowh dow singla kown mih tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Amatni dow tawncher hawmh hai tangbung uang pawla büah khai; amatni dow plawng hawmh iawng uang büah khai. Amatni kowh maru iun hai <char style="w">ut</char> kawm dow nowng rüaah dowi mowr chekhai. Amatni dow Israeluüa kowh süng hing piakta pe nak khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Midianuüa mih Israeluüa kowh uanh maten pawta pe bowk khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar se awr lü khowng khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7-8" />Midianuüa changah anowng apowng kowh CHAKRAMANG tut-e Israeluüa awr kar khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih uang chin pe risi lowk ia khai. Nami risi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih maiawng, ‘Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia uang lawtla enni mih dow ang chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 6:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Aiguptauüa rut hownia hai chang enni anowng apowng miuüa rut hownia dow ang uang lawngla enni khai. Kananuüa kowi enni pur hownia ang prütah hanow amatni kowh pren mih ang pe enni khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih enni kowh Thurai pami ang tek enni khowk. Now enni uowiah mih pren kowi kowh Amawruüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi natawi chupiia dowi kown mih paw ang tek enni khowk. Nachenganchepaw ang laiklow enni sünta dowi chekhai,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gideawn tut-e CHAKRAMANG uang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Akat khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih Ofra marow kowi uang khai, now Joas kowh sasua singh tut kowi uang chowm khai. Joas dow Abiezer krungchak chekhai. Joas kowh chapa Gideawn dow Midianuüa hownia naia petla püm kownkow nami re-e kowh grep thuara kowi kukpa thua püm khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih Gideawn tut-e uang tatüng hanow tek pe mih, “Aw tasen kürma mih maru, CHAKRAMANG mih tawi uowila en reng chekhai!” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gideawn tek pe kramamu mih, “Chakramang, anging tut-e CHAKRAMANG tawi uowi e tawngplawng kowchow maiawngün anging luk kowi uang tuk phaw khai? Anging kowh pipu-uüa chiala anging mih CHAKRAMANG kowh awdara lup tawng kowi chow cham kowi khai? Anging kowh pipu-uüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla mih dow CHAKRAMANG ngengche chekhai pami amatni chiala anging khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG nuata anging khai bowt. Aia dow Midianuüa rut kowi ap anging khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />CHAKRAMANG dow Gideawn prakowi haidangah hanow tek pe mih, “En matia kowh kür hown tarü diah, now Midianuüa rut hownia Israeluüa kowi uang lawngla diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang matia ngengche chin en khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gideawn tek pe mih, “Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, tawng iawng chow Israeluüa kowi ang nalawngah kown? Ang krungchak dow Manase krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang sowm mih krungchak chekhai. Now ang matia paw anging kimchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh alow tawi uowi dowi mih maru chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Gideawn mih, “Ang natawi uowila en reng kown taih. Now Midianuüa maten kowi maru lowk iachow kowi kowh iawng en nanowngta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gideawn tek pe mih, “En che saksing sana ang khai hanow ang hown taklang mih dow CHAKRAMANG ching chekhai pami natukla kownkow tüng ang amatra lowk diah. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Ang uang plan kowh en pur kowi ang uang ap en uanap dowi mowr sakrauma hown hang powt diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En uang plan dowi mowr ang hawt chawng en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Now Gideawn dow kim kowi kowkowi khai, now kowngen rua chah apum hanow engah khai. Now kawmdi hamüt set ngia hown the pe tuah dowi mih kawm thawpah sangrum khai. Aia dow chaknga sek mih kharang kowi lang towah khai, now kan tui dow puh kowi lang towah khai. Naiawngün dow sasua singh tut kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu pur kowi aia uang towah khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Nakhowk khe Thurai kowh kramamu tek pe Gideawn mih, “Chaknga hai the pe tuah dowi mih kawm mami huaklu luk kowi towah diah, now kan tui dow naiawngün luk kowi iu klaiah diah,” pakhai. Gideawn dow CHAKRAMANG tek iawng chang khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu rut kowi dow raitua uowi lowk chekhai. Now aia dow nami raitua towr hown chaknga hai the pe tuah dowi mih kawm kowi iu kakah khai. Nahanow huaklu hownia maih awr lün hanow nami chaknga hai kawm dow kam khai. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih tama khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Nakhowk khe nami maru dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu chekhai pami Gideawn tuk khai bowt. Now aia dow takrow se tek mih, “Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG! En kowh kramamu kowi achingma ang khi khai!” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Thaulangma uowi diah! Hangkow kram diah! En kowng dowi tham!” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Now Gideawn dow CHAKRAMANG vüi nami re-e thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Aming dow Jehova-Salawm pahai chap pe khai. (Jehova-Salawm pami dow “CHAKRAMANG chowtaih thaulangra” pami chekhai). Nami phuchuara dow Abiezeruüa kowh uowi rah Ofra kowi kawmat pat paw uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gideawn piakta pe Baal thurai kowh phuchuara mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Nami iak khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Gideawn mih, “En pa kowh chiala pre pum mih hownia ranit ning mih chiala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">chiala pre pum mih hownia ranit ning mih chiala </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char></note> kowpaw apum diah. Nami kung kowi dow akroma mih arah kowi kowh Baal thurai vüi en pa thawpah mih phuchuara kowpiakta diah, now aria aret kowi kowh Asera limpu paw kowkripta bowk diah. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Now nami arah kowi dow CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai vüi kaneuma kowthawp phuchuara lowk diah. Nami kung kowi dow nami phuchuara kowi mih en kripah mih Asera limpu hown changla maih hanow chiala hown tikah mih uanap changla diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Naiawng rakowi Gideawn dow aia kowh naruüa pungmadawng hownia lang ruiah hamüt ia khai, now amatni dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng chang khai. Aia dow naiawngün lup mih ni-e chang dowi kowi iak-e changah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow amatni kimchakuüa hai marowchakuüa kowi kram kowh chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Now auai rau marowchakuüa awr rü hanow Baal thurai kowh phuchuara piakta pe mih hai aria aret kowi kowh Asera limpu kripta pe mih dow khi büah khai. Nami klen kowi nami arah kowi plan thawp phuchuara lowk hanow chiala hown chang pe phuchua mih paw khi büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow lowkkowlowk talünta mih, “Mami lup amia chow chang?” pabüah khai. Now amatni mih kaneuma krawi paw satang hanow naiawngün lup dow Joas kowh chapa Gideawn chang mih chekhai pami tuk büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Now marowchakuüa dow Joas tut-e kowkowiah hanow tek pe mih, “En kowh chapa kowi uang lawtla! Aia kowi nakowngta kown takla. Aia dow Baal thurai kowh phuchuara piakta khai, now aria aret kowi kowh Asera limpu paw kripta khai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Nachenganchepaw aia tut-e uang miuüa kowi Joas tek pe mih, “Baal thurai kowi enni tangila mih bow? Aia kowi enni nalawngah kown mih bow? Aia kowi tawi tangila mih maru kowi dow tharau rau-e nakowngta kown. Baal che thurai ching chekhai hanow aia kowh phuchuara piakta pe khowk chedow aiamat pacham talawng lah!” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Nami ni hownia dow Gideawn kowi mih Jerub-Baal pahai Joas rük pe ming khai. (Jerub-Baal pami dow “Baal thurai matia pacham talawng lah” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow Joas tek mih, “Baal thurai kowh phuchuara dow Gideawn piakta pe khai; naiawng rakowi Baal thurai mih aiamat pacham talawng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gideawn kük amatra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Nami kung kowi dow Midianuüa, Amalekuüa hai satlawt pra kowh prenchakuüa mih arasang takua talawm büah khai. Now amatni dow nakowsen Israeluüa kownkow haipown Jawrdan aw hanow Jezrel lawngrawi kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla mih Gideawn kowi kruitownah khai. Now aia dow Abiezeruüa kowi hawah kownkow tum baw khai. Now Abiezeruüa dow aia re-e uang takua talawm khai. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Nami klen kowi aia dow Manase, Aser, Zebulun hai Naptali krungchakuüa tut-e paw krawi phowngla pe satang khai. Now naiawngün krungchak maru-uüa paw Gideawn re-e uang takua talawm khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36-37" />Nami khin khe Gideawn tek pe Thurai mih, “Israeluüa kowi nakowlawngah kownkow en tawi khowng ang kown pami en kham ang khai. Nami laikham iawng en nachang kown mih natukla kownkow tüng ang amatra diah. Aiak mih cha thuara kowi ang natowla ruapur pawi kown. Now tharau rau-e khe nami ruapur pawi kowi krowngchow <char style="w">nang</char> tui mih pe klaah diah, now akeng mih rah kowi dow akang khawngma changah diah. Nahanow Israeluüa kowi nakowlawngah kownkow en natawi khowng ang kown pami ang natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 6:36-37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Now nami iawng dow uang phaw khai. Gideawn dow auai rau murpa awr rü hanow ruapur pawi hownia kowpet nang tui khai. Nami nang tui dow biatum lowk mih tek mawp khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Nami kung kowi dow Gideawn plan tek pe Thurai mih, “Hauang kunmarau ang diah; ang plan tek en pakatchow tak. Sakrauma hown ruapur pawi hown pe chaing ang akatchow iawk diah. Khaleng dow ruapur pawi mih akang khawngma changah diah, now krawng luk kowi nang tui pe klaah diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Nami iak paw Gideawn tek iawng Thurai chang pe khai. Nahanow ruapur pawi krowngchow dow akang khawngma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw krawng kowi dow nang tui uang kla khai.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Midianuüa kowi Gideawn nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Auai rau dow Gideawn hai aia kowh maru maten mih murpa rü hanow Harawd pami tuikuam re-e kowkhup tangbung khai. Nakhowk khe amatni kowh ransu Midianuüa uowi mih dow Harawd pami tuikuam tawngphak pra kowh Mawre hungh re-e kowh lawngrawi kowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Gideawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En kowh maru iun kawm lai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Midianuüa kowi enni rut kowi ang naap enni kown nadowi. Ang ap enni khai hanow enni natamata ang kown chekhai; enni natek kown mih, ‘Anging ka lawngra mih anging matia kür hown chowtaih,’ napa kown. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa kowi kowtek pe diah, ‘Kram miuüa dow Gilead hungh hownia kim prakowi naia plan kown taih,’ pape diah,” pakhai. Nahanow maru iun 22,000 ia dow plan khai, now ta uowi mih dow maru iun 10,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Nakhowk khe Gideawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Kawmat paw maru iun hu lai tak. Naiawngün maru kawmuüa kowi aw kowi kowpawla diah. Nakowi mih en vüi amatni kowi ang nakloah kown. ‘Nami maru en hown natawi kown,’ pache ang tek now nami maru en hown natawi kown. Now, ‘Nami maru en hown natawi kown nadowi,’ pache ang tek now nami maru en hown natawi kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Naiawng rakowi Gideawn mih maru kawmuüa kowi aw kowi kowpawla khai. Nakowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Rutpha hown vürah kowh kham tui miuüa hownia tua kung se kui iawng bia laplap kham tui miuüa kowi lang kraah diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Now maru iun 300 ia dow amatni kowh rutpha hown vürah now kham tui khai. Tawkche akeng miuüa dow kham tui khe tua kung se kui iawng bia laplap khai. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Nakhowk khe Gideawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Rutpha hown vürah now kham tui mih maru 300 ia hown ang nalawng enni kown, now Midianuüa kowi ang naap enni kown. Akeng miuüa dow kowmatia kim kowi pacham mang bowk lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Naiawng rakowi Gideawn mih maru iun 300 ia mih kowi towah khai, now akeng miuüa kowi dow chakkham hai baw maten ta pe towla hanow chowlowkkow kim kowi plan chinta bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:8">Midianuüa kowh tangbung khup rah dow Gideawn kowh tangbung khup rah dakchow kowi kowh lawngrawi kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Nami iak khe Gideawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Rü diah, kowdowm now kowbüah kowh tangbung khup rah kowi kowsen diah. Kowbüah kowh tangbung khup rah dow en rut kowi ang apta mih chowbowt. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Kowsen kown che en kram khai hanow en kowh nar Fura kowi pawla now Midianuüa kowh tangbung khup rah re-e kowkowi diah. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Now tawng ngai chow tatek büah mih kowsam sünta madiah. Nahanow amatni kowi nasenah kownkow en nakram kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Gideawn mih aia kowh nar Fura kowi pawla now Midian siphaiuüa kowh tangbung khup rah ria kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Gideawn kowdowmah mih lawngrawi kowi uowi mih dow Midianuüa, Amalekuüa hai satlawt pra kowh pren hownia kowh maru atekma chekhai; amatni dow dung kawm iawng thur liplip khai. Now amatni kowh ut kawm paw sata pang kowi kowh sema nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Nakowi Gideawn kowtowm khe maru lowk ia mih aia auiua kowi phat pe mang khai. Aia tek pe mih, “Auiua ow, ang khi mang lowk. Mang lak kowi ang khi mih maiawng: Püm hown kowh thawpah mih kawm uang lün lutlut now a-i Midianuüa kowh tangbung lowk mih kowi uang chawnah khai. Nami kawm dow amaisang uang chawnah mih a-i kowh tangbung taplan pluk now hing tim khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Nakhowk khe a-auiua klangah mih, “Nami dow Israel chenchap Joas kowh chapa Gideawn kowh saidawng klen kowi tawngpaw nadowi chekhai. Thurai mih a-i Midianuüa hailawm a-i kowh tangbung khup rah maten Gideawn rut kowi apta mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Nami uarmang hai nami auan tata now Gideawn mih tabawkah krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah khai. Now aia dow Israeluüa kowh tangbung khup rah kowi uang plan hanow atünma uang tek mih, “Rü büa diah. Thurai mih Midianuüa kowh siphaiuüa kowi a-i rut kowi apta khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Now maru iun 300 ia kowi aia changah sum thum khai. Aia dow lowk ia e baw lowk, tuikawng khaw lowk, now nami tuikawng lak kowi tow pe maitawng lowk chi khai. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Nami kung kowi aia tek pe mih, “Enni bowkbowk ang prakowi napela ching reng kown takla, now ang chang iawng enni paw natawi chang kown takla. Tangbung khup rah re-e ang kowting khe ang chang iawng enni natawi chang kown takla. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Now ang hown kowh tawi miuüa hailawm anging bowkbowk tum baw khe tangbung khup rah riaret hownia enni paw natawi tum baw kown. Now atünma enni natek kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG vüi hai Gideawn vüi,’ napa kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Uar dawng khe kowh kangchawng miuüa tale mih khin khe Midianuüa kowh kangchawng mih tale klowpchow kung kowi Gideawn hai aia kowh 100 ia mih maru-uüa dow tangbung khup rah re-e kowting khai. Gideawn hai aia hown kowh tawi miuüa dow amatni kowh baw mih tum büah hanow amatni kowh tuikawng khaw teuta büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Now akeng mih pre thum trui paw akrowksang naiawng chang büah khai. Amatni kowh lakuai rut hown dow maitawng, now hawmlawm rut hown dow baw dowkla büah khai. Amatni dow atünma tek mih, “Mami saidawng dow CHAKRAMANG hai Gideawn vüi chekhai,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Tangbung khup rah tapat lut khowm bowkta mih iowngra re-e Gideawn kowh maru-uüa iowng khe Midianuüa maten dow hekla se powt mih iowmla prung khai.<verse eid="JDG 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Maru iun 300 ia awr tum baw mih khin khe tangbung khup rah lak kowi kowh uowi miuüa mih amatni lala saidawng hown tatu tasawt prungrung kown mih CHAKRAMANG chang pe khai. Nahanow Midianuüa kowh siphai hawmh dow Zerera pra kowh Bet-Sitta mowr, now Tabat marow re-e kowh Abel-Mehola marow rihi mowr kowpowt büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia Naptali, Aser hai Manase krungchakuüa maten kowi Gideawn uang hawla khai, now Midianuüa kowi kawikrawiah büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Akung kowi Gideawn mih Efraim hungma mawngma süng maten kowi krawi chin pe maru hanow krawi tek pe mih, “Enni bowkbowk uang dowm büa diah. Now Midianuüa kowi uang tawi khowng sen büa diah. Bet-Bara mowr mih awchawng awlang hai Jawrdan aw nowng pownah krowngchow mih arah maten kowkrawi powngta büa diah,” pape khai. Nahanow Efraim kowi kowh maru maten dow takua talawm now Jawrdan aw nowng pownah krowngchow mih arah maten hai awchawng awlang maten Bet-Bara mowr krawi powngta khai. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Amatni dow Midianuüa kowh aluchow Oreb hai Zeb iüah kowi khümta khai. Now Oreb kowi dow Oreb kowh huamang re-e saita büah khai, now Zeb kowi dow Zeb kowh grep uih küara re-e saita büah khai. Amatni dow Midianuüa kowi kawikrawiah khai, now Oreb hai Zeb iüah kowh lu dung dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi Gideawn tut-e kowpawla büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah kowi Gideawn nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Akung kowi Efraimuüa tek pe Gideawn mih, “Kowsen Midianuüa kownkow tarü mih khin tawngplawng kowchow en hawla anging dowi? Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang anging khai?” pakhai. Naiawng hai amatni dow Gideawn kowi lainowmma nangah khai.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Nachenganchepaw Gideawn tek pe amatni mih, “Enni lak-e ang lang changta hu mih tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. Enni Efraimuüa lümah dowk mih grep uih khowm padow anging Abiezeruüa rik lüngah mih grep uih lak-e lang iung nadowi bow? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Midianuüa kowh mang Oreb hai Zeb iüah kowi Thurai mih enni rut kowi ap enni khai. Enni hown che tuah now ang dow tawngpaw lang chang hu dowi chekhai,” pape khai. Naiawng Gideawn tek mih ta hanow aia luk kowi kowh Efraimuüa kowh kunmaraura dow prowng khai bowt.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Gideawn hai aia kowh 300 ia mih maru-uüa dow Jawrdan aw re-e uang ting hanow haipown Jawrdan aw büah khai. Amatni dow bowm mih nowm khowk chepaw ransu-uüa kowi krawi ia um dowi mowr kawikrawi büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Now Sukawt marow kowi kowting büah khe Gideawn tek pe marowchakuüa mih, “Sakrauma hown ang kowh siphai hawmh kowi pe chaah chakkham ne dit. Kowbüah dow bowm mih nowm khowk. Kawmat mowr kowi Midianuüa kowh mang Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah kowi anging krawi um dowi tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Nachenganchepaw Sukawt marow kowi kowh aluchowuüa tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh siphai hawmh kowi anging napeah chakkham kown? Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah kowi enni krawi ia khümta khowk bow?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gideawn tek pe mih, “Iung taih! CHAKRAMANG dow Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah kowi anging rut kowi naap anging kown. Nami kung kowi dow enni tut-e anging nauang plan uang iawk kown. Nakhowk khe chiang süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh chuh hai chuh kangowh mih singh hown nga tasek pat anging nabawp enni kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Nami kung kowi dow Gideawn mih Sukawt hownia Penuel marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now nakowi kowh maru-uüa tut-e paw aia mih kowlü chakkham khai. Tawkche nakowi kowh maru-uüa paw Sukawt marowchakuüa tek iawng Gideawn kowi hawt tek pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Naiawng rakowi Penuel marowchakuüa kowi Gideawn tek pe mih, “Tasen awng kung kowi enni tut-e ang nauang plan uang iawk kown. Nakhowk khe mami kimkrowng ang napiakta enni nak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Nami khin khe Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah dow amatchi kowh siphai hawmh hown Karkawr marow kowi uowi khai. Satlawt pra kowh pren hownia siphaiuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ta sing mih dow 15,000 ia towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowng mih dow 120,000 ia khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gideawn dow Noba marow hai Jawkbeha marow satlawt prakowi kowh tiama iawng kowkowi khai. Now Midianuüa kowh siphai mingmang dowi khe Gideawn mih kowsenah khai. Ransu-uüa dow naiawng Gideawn nauang senah kown mih hing ka tuak dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Naiawng kowsenah mih khin khe Midianuüa kowh mang Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah dow ku powt khai. Nachenganchepaw Gideawn dow amatchi kowi kawikrawiah hanow krawi khümta khai. Now amatchi kowh siphai hawmh maten dow Gideawn rakowi lainowmma kram khai.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Nami kung kowi Joas kowh chapa Gideawn mih Heres pami pangchowng iawng tasenra hownia uang plan khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Gideawn mih Sukawt marow hownia uang khümla klanguüa lowk ia khai. Now aia dow nami klanguüa kowi marow kowi kowh maru iukuüa ming hai lawngtang aluchowuüa ming lüntaah khai. Nahanow nami klanguüa dow naiawngün 77 ia ming rui pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Gideawn mih Sukawt marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now tek pe marowchakuüa mih, “Mow, Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah. Ang uang rik uang khe dow enni khare ang khai. Nakhowk khe enni tek ang mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh siphai hawmh kowi anging napeah chakkham kown? Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah kowi enni krawi ka khüm khowk bow?’ pakhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Nahanow Gideawn mih Sukawt marow kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi khümah khai. Now amatni kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh chuh hai chuh kangowh mih singh hown bawpah khai. Naiawng hai amatni kowi dow Gideawn ripah khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih Penuel marow kowi kowkowi khai. Aia dow nakowi kowh kimkrowng mih piakta pe khai, now marow kowi kowh kachakuüa kowi paw aia saita bowk khai.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Nami kung kowi Gideawn tek pe Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah mih, “Tabawr hungh kowi kowh enchi kowngta mih maru-uüa tawng iawng mih maru chow?” pakhai. Kowiüah tek pe mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa dow en iawng; kowbüah dow mang chapa iawng kangowh chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gideawn tek pe mih, “Naiawngünuüa dow ang tainau-uüa chekhai, amatni dow a-u kowh chapauüa chekhai. Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang tek khowk; naiawngünuüa kowi enchi che saita dowi e dow ang paw sai enchi dowi tham diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Nami kung kowi achapa ta Jether kowi Gideawn tek pe mih, “Kowiüah kowi sai madiah!” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Jether dow kram kowh aia kowh saidawng iu howk dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ning diachow taih tak chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Nakhowk khe Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah tek pe Gideawn mih, “En phai uang sai angching towbowt! En che kachakuüa chah ching chekhai hanow uang sai angching diah,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Gideawn dow amatchi pre ia kowi saita khai. Now amatchi kowh ut ngawng kowi kowh kuh ngawng awr dow klüpah hanow pawta pe khai.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gideawn kowh ephawd kowrmow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Nami kung kowi Israeluüa tek pe Gideawn mih, “Midianuüa rut hownia en lawng anging khai. Naiawng rakowi en hai en kowh krungchakuüa mih anging kowh kruitown miia chowng towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gideawn tek pe amatni mih, “Ang dow enni kowh kruitown mih nachowng kown nadowi, now ang kowh chapa paw enni kowh kruitown mih nachowng kown nadowi; CHAKRAMANG chowtaih enni kowh kruitown mih nachowng kown,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Gideawn plan tek pe mih, “Ang lü enni kown mih uanh uowi pachap. Ransu-uüa hownia kowh enni uang kala mih kuh ramseng maten pe ang büa diah,” pakhai. (Tawngplawng kowchow panow Midianuüa dow Ismael krungchakuüa chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Ismaeluüa dow kuh ramseng ü bowk chekhai).<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Israeluüa tek pe Gideawn mih, “Ow, anging nape en kown taih,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow be pe uan lowk khai, now nami uan luk kowi amatni chowlowkkow kala mih kuh ramseng maten peta büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Naiawngün kuh ramseng dow bowkbowk kowi adik 20 set ngia chekhai. Nami klen kowi Gideawn kowh dow kuh leng, kuh hown kowh akeng mih tatawng müa uanh, Midian manguüa khupah mih mintau pau rawng uan hai ut kowi kowh ü pe mih kuh ngawng awr ün uowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gideawn dow naiawngün kuh hown thawp ephawd kowrmow lowk khai, now aia uowi rah Ofra marow kowi towah khai. Now nakowi dow Israeluüa maten mih CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm dowi iawng nami ephawd kowrmow kowi uang chupiia büah khai. Nami dow Gideawn hai aia kimchakuüa vüi leng kowi tasowk khe kowh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Naiawng hai Israeluüa mih Midianuüa kowi senah khai. Amatni dow Israeluüa pur kowi mapaw kownowng iowng dowi bowt chekhai. Gideawn sing uowi mowr dow pren mih 40 ning mowr thaulangma chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gideawn kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Tasen kung kowi Joas kowh chapa Jerub-Baal dow aia kim kowi kowplan khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gideawn kowh dow masi akawmma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh dow chapa uowi 70 ia chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Sekem marow kowi paw aia <char style="w">changla masi mih narma</char> uowi lowk ia. Nami masi hown paw aia dow ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia chekhai. Aming dow Abimelek pahai Gideawn rük pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Joas kowh chapa Gideawn dow lawngtangma khe kowng khai. Aia kowi dow a-pa Joas tadupra kowi dupah khai. Nami tadupra dow Abiezeruüa kowh Ofra marow kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Gideawn kowng kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm dowi iawng Baal thuraiuüa kowi cham plan chupiia büah khai. Amatni dow Baal-Berit kowi changla thurai büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Amatni dow amatni riaret kowi kowh ransu-uüa hownia lawngah mih CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi tamata büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Jerub-Baal dow Israeluüa vüi aiungma changla pe khowk chowdiah. Tawkche amatni dow aia kimchakuüa vüi aiungma chang pe dowi chekhai. (Jerub-Baal dow Gideawn chekhai).<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Atainau-uüa kowi Abimelek saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Jerub-Baal kowh chapa Abimelek mih Sekem marow kowi kowh apu-uüa tut-e kowkowiah now apu-uüa kowi hai a-u kowh krungchakuüa maten kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Amatni vüi tawng mih chow lang iung mih Sekem kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten kowi krawi lünta büah madiah, ‘Jerub-baal kowh chapa 70 ia mih bow enni kowh kruitown mih nachowng kown? Dow now maru lowk iachow bow enni kowh kruitown mih nachowng kown?’ pape khai. Now ang paw enni hown pabuk panga chak pami hangkow tamata büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Now nami laiklow dow Abimelek kowh pu-uüa mih Sekem kowi kowh aluchowuüa maten kowi krawi tek pe khai. Nami kung kowi dow Sekem marow kowi kowh maru maten Abimelek prakowi tawi tangi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Abimelek dow amatni hown tasin taken mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Amatni dow Bal-Berit thurai kim hownia tai 70 iun pawah now Abimelek kowi peah khai. Nami tai hown Abimelek mih cham ngala maru ngakuüa khai. Now naiawngün maru ngakuüa dow aia kung tawi krawi khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Aia dow Ofra kowi a-pa kim kowi kowkowiah now aia kowh tainau-uüa 70 ia kowi huamang lowkchow mih luk kowi saita bowk khai. Naiawngün atainau-uüa dow Jerub-baal kowh chapa kangowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Jerub-baal kowh chapa lang sawi mih Jotham dow tapet hanow ia plai khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Nami kung kowi dow Sekem hai Bet-Milo kowi kowh aluchowuüa maten takuaah now Sekem re-e kowh Awk singh chimsaima mih re-e Abimelek kowi thawpah mang khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jotham kowh laiuat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Naiawngün satang tata now Jotham mih Gerizim hungh chut kowi kowpün khai. Now atünma maru kawmuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Sekem kowi kowh uowi miuüa low, ang laiklow sünta büa diah. Nahanow Thurai paw enni kowh laiklow nasünta enni kown. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Akat khe mih singh kau maten amatni vüi cham krawi thawp mang kownkow cham krawi kowi khai. Now kanrawn singh kowi tek pe büah mih, ‘Kanrawn singh ow, chowm a-i mang dit snow,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Nakhowk khe kanrawn singh hawt klangah mih, ‘Ang kowh sau hown dow maru hai Thurai ka ringkawra reng chekhai. Nami towta hanow singh kau maten luk kowi tak ü ang krawi kruitown kown?’ pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Nami kung kowi uidut singh kowi tek pe büah mih, ‘Uidut singh ow, chowm a-i mang dit snow,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Nakhowk khe uidut singh paw hawt klangah mih, ‘Ang dow asowrma hai adingma mih uih thawp reng chekhai. Nami towta hanow singh kau maten luk kowi tak ü ang krawi kruitown kown?’ pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Nami kung kowi grep ruih kowi tek pe büah mih, ‘Grep ruih ow, chowm a-i mang dit snow,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Nakhowk khe grep ruih paw hawt klangah mih, ‘Ang kowh uih tui hown Thurai hai maru piaw reng chekhai. Nami towta hanow singh kau maten luk kowi tak ü ang krawi kruitown kown?’ pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Achur nowm nowm kowi singh kau maten chuh mung kowi tek pe mih, ‘Chuh mung ow, chowm a-i mang dit snow,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Nakhowk khe chuh mung hawt klangah mih, ‘Enni che pe chowm ang mang kown nau nowm now ang kowh klim kowi uang rik tanai büa diah. Naiawng che enni nauta dowi now chuh mung hownia maih awr lün now Lebanawn kowi kowh sidar singh kowi pacham kamta bowk lah,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Nami laiuat ki tek pe kung kowi Jotham tek pe iawk mih, “Sünta büah, Abimelek kowi enni thawpah mang mih kaah sakowm mih lup hai anowmma mih lup pabow enni ka tuak? Apa Gideawn hai aia kimchak luk kowi enni changah aiung mih hai taka klowk khowk pabow enni ka tuak? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Ang kowh pa dow aia nakowng kown mih kowi tuakla dowi matchang dowk tasen hanow Midianuüa rut hownia lawng enni khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Nachenganchepaw ani mih aia kowh kimchakuüa kowi enni kingküaah khai. Aia kowh chapa 70 ia kowi huamang lowkchow mih luk kowi enni kowngta pe bowk khai, now aia kowh narma chah Abimelek kowi Sekem kowi kowh maru-uüa luk kowi enni pe chowmah mang khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Abimelek dow enni hown tasin taken mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Nachenganchepaw ani che enni mih Gideawn hai aia kimchakuüa luk kowi kaah sakowmma hai anowmma mih lup enni chang pe khai e dow Abimelek mih enni vüi awmrawmra pachowng lah, now enni paw aia kowh awmrawmra pachowng lah. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Tawkche kaah sakowmma hai anowmma mih lup enni che chang pe dowi hanow Abimelek hownia maih uang lawt hanow enni Sekem kowi kowh uowi miuüa luk kowi hai Bet-Milo kowi kowh uowi miuüa luk kowi pacham kamah lah. Now enni Sekem kowi kowh uowi miuüa hai Bet-Milo kowi kowh uowi miuüa hownia paw maih uang lawt hanow Abimelek kowi pacham kamah lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Nami kung kowi dow Jotham mih Ber pami arah kowi kowpowt khai. Aia dow ataimow Abimelek kowi kram kowh nakowi hing uowi khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sekem marowchakuüa kingküa Abimelek mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimelek mih sum ning mowr Israeluüa kowi kruitownah khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Nami kung kowi dow Thurai mih Abimelek hai Sekem kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi uang chin pe lümla ngak khai. Naiawng rakowi Sekem kowi kowh aluchowuüa mih Abimelek hown taran khai. Nahanow Sekem kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Abimelek kowi kingküaah khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Naiawng Abimelek kowi Thurai changah mih dow Gideawn kowh chapa 70 ia kowi saita mih lu klai Abimelek luk kowi naia pawla kownkow chekhai, now kowbüah kowi saiah khe kowh Abimelek kowi tawi khowngah mih Sekem kowi kowh maru-uüa luk kowi naia paw lu klai kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Sekem kowi kowh maru-uüa dow Abimelek kowi kingküaah kownkow hungh luk kowi tow maru sangrum khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow tapetah hanow nami tiama iawng uang mang miuüa kowi changah damra khai. Tawkche nami lawnguan kowi Abimelek mih tawi ta khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Nami khin khe Ebed kowh chapa Gal mih aia kowh tainau-uüa kowi pawla now Sekem kowi uang khai, now Sekem kowi kowh maru-uüa mih aia kowi owmah khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Akung kowi amatni dow amatni kowh grep krum hownia klek grep uih hanow thawp grep tui khai, now chang pawi büah khai. Amatni dow amatni kowh thurai kim kowi kowkowiah now cha büah kham büah khai, now Abimelek kowi peah piati büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Ebed kowh chapa Gal tek mih, “Mia chow Abimelek? Tawngplawng kowchow Sekem kowi kowh a-i uowi miuüa aia nimkrüa kowi nauowi kown? Aia dow Gideawn kowh chapa nadowi bow? Aia kowh siphai aluchow dow Zebul nadowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow Abimelek nimkrüa kowi a-i nauowi kown? Sekem kowh pa Hamawr krungchakuüa nimkrüa kowi phai i uowi diah sik. <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Maru kawmuüa che ang kowh ana pek chün panü dow Abimelek kowi ang naprütta kown taih diah. Abimelek kowi ang natek pe kown mih, ‘En kowh siphai hawmh kowi kuala now uang a-i tasen lah,’ pape kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Ebed kowh chapa Gal kowh nami laiklow dow Sekem kowi kowh kruitown mih Zebul tawi ta khai, now aia dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Aia dow kukpa Abimelek kowi maiawng krawi tek pe khai, “Ebed kowh chapa Gal hai atainau-uüa mih Sekem kowi uangah now nakingküa en kownkow maru kawmuüa kowi chükah khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Naiawng rakowi en hailawm en kowh maru-uüa mih uar-e uangah now dowm kowi uang hawt chawng diah. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Now sat lawt khe Sekem marow kowi uang senah diah. Now Gal hai aia kowh maru-uüa nauang sen en kownkow uang lawt mih khin khe tawng chow en nau changah kown mih changah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Naiawng rakowi Abimelek mih aia kowh siphai maten kowi changah tali thum now uar-e lawt khai, now Sekem marow ria kowi uang tapet büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Ebed kowh chapa Gal dow marow hownia uang lawt hanow tapplawt re-e uang iowng khai. Nakhowk khe Abimelek hai aia kowh maru-uüa mih amatni tapetra hownia uang lawt prung khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Nami khita hanow Zebul kowi Gal tek pe mih, “Mü madiah, hungh luk hownia maru kawm uang dowm iualua taih,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Nakhowk khe Zebul klangah mih, “Maru nadowi pai iow, hungh nim kowi en nüla maru mih taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Nachenganchepaw Gal plan tek pe mih, “Mü diah le, hungh lang lowng mih hownia paw maru kawmuüa uang haimang pathum, now hawra sarauüa kowh hawra mükra sasua singh hownia paw uang haimang pathum,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Nakhowk khe Zebul klangah iawk mih, “Sow, en kowh laiklow aiuk aiukma mih? En tek mih, ‘Abimelek mia chow? Tawngplawng kowchow aia nimkrüa kowi a-i uowi kown?’ pakhai. En prawng renah miuüa dow marow uat kowi uowi chekhai. Khaleng dow lawt now kowbüah hown kowtasen bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Nakhowk khe Gal dow Sekem marow kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi hawla now Abimelek hown kowtasen khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimelek kawikrawiah now Gal dow powt khai. Powt büah mih khin khe Gal kowh maru-uüa dow ka arau kowh patiama rawng tapplawt mowr takuakla pan khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimelek dow Aruma marow kowi kowmang khai bowt. Now Zebul dow Gal hai atainau-uüa kowi kawikrawiah now Sekem marow hownia lawtta khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Auai ni khe Sekem kowi kowh maru-uüa mih marow hownia uang lawt now dowm kowi uang khai, now nami satang Abimelek kowi kowphowng pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Nakhowk khe Abimelek dow aia maru-uüa kowi changah sum thum khai. Now amatni dow dowm kowi hawt tapet khai. Marow hownia maru-uüa uang lawt mih khita now amatni dow hawt senah khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimelek hai aia thumchak maru-uüa dow pur prakowi kowkowi hanow marow tapplawt kowi kowhawt iowng khai. Now akeng mih pre thum mih dow dowm kowi kowh uowi mih Sekem marowchakuüa kowi hawt senah now kowngta büah bowk khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Ni chut tasen hanow Sekem marow dow Abimelek powngta khai, now nami marow kowi kowh maru maten kowi aia saita bowk khai. Nami kung kowi dow marow mih piakta bowk now krawi prui pe awisa büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Nami satang tata hanow Sekem marow kowi kowh kimkrowng kowi uowi mih aluchowuüa mih El-Berit pami thurai kim lak kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi kowkup büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47-48" />El-Berit pami thurai kim kowi maru-uüa takua talawm mih satang dow Abimelek paw tawi ta khai. Nahanow aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi pawla now Zalmawn hungh kowi kowpün khai. Now aia dow pawla marek lowk hanow cham do singh mia khai, now naiawngün singh mia dow aia pangkawt hown kawtla lawmlawm khai. Nami kung kowi aia maru-uüa kowi aia peah ana mih, “Ang chang iawng alenma tawi chang büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 9:47-48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowh maru-uüa maten paw do singh mia hanow kawtla büah khai, now Abimelek kung tawi krawi khai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ria kowi naiawngün singh mia krawi towah büah hanow towkah büah khai. Nami maih hown dow Sekem marow kowi kowh kimkrowng kowi kowh maru maten kowng khai. Nakowi kowh kowng mih nget dow masiuüa hai kachakuüa 1,000 ia ngia chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Nami kung kowi dow Abimelek mih Thebez marow kowi rumah now senah khai, now nami marow dow aia powngta khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Nami marow kowi dow kimkrowng uowi lowk chekhai. Nami kimkrowng kowi dow marow kowi kowh maru maten kowpowt khai. Amatni dow nami kimkrowng lak kowi kowkup hanow kimplawt mih büngta büah khai, now amatni dow kimkrowng luk kowi kowpün büah bowk khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52-53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52-53" />Now Abimelek mih nami kimkrowng re-e kowkowiah now kowsenah khai. Nachenganchepaw nami kimkrowng kowi natowkah kownkow kimplawt re-e Abimelek kowkowi khe masiuüa lowk ia mih kawm küa müa hua hown amaisang kuakah mih Abimelek kowh lu teuta pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:52-53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Nakhowk khe Abimelek mih alenma aia kowh tasen müa <char style="w">rutchün khawkleng</char> kawt mih klanguüa kowi tek pe mih, “‘Masiuüa rut kowi Abimelek kowng khai,’ pami maru naia tekla dowi kownkow en kowh saidawng akawp hownia howkah now uai sai ang diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami klanguüa mih saidawng hown Abimelek kowi haisawtah khai, now Abimelek dow kowng khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Abimelek kowng khowk mih khita hanow Israeluüa dow amatni chowlowkkow kim kowi mang khai bowt.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Abimelek mih atainau-uüa 70 ia kowi saita mih hai a-pa luk kowi kowh aia changta angak mih sung dow naiawng hai Thurai sat pe klai khai. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Now Sekem kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi paw amatni kowh angak sung Thurai sat pe klai khai. Naiawng hai Gideawn kowh chapa Jotham kowh piati dow amatni luk kowi uang kla khai.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s1">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Abimelek kowng kung kowi dow Israeluüa kowi nalawngah kownkow Tola mih uang chowng tara chet mih khai. Aia dow Isakar krungchak chekhai. A-pa dow Pua, now Pua kowh pa dow Dodo chekhai. Tola uowi mih dow Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh Samir marow kowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Aia dow 23 ning mowr Israeluüa kowi kruitownla khai. Now aia kowng hanow aia kowi dow Samir marow kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Jair</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Tola kowng kung kowi dow Jair mih Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih uang chowng khai. Aia dow 22 ning mowr Israeluüa kowi kruitownla khai. Aia dow Gilead süng kowi kowh maru chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Jair kowh dow chapa uowi 30 ia chekhai. Now achapauüa kowh dow kawrngaramchük uowi lowk chi chekhai. Now amatni kowh dow Gilead süng kowi marow uowi 30 klüng chekhai. Naiawngün marow kowi dow kawmat pat paw Jair Kowh Marow pahai maru tek pe reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Jair kowng hanow aia kowi dow Kamawn marow kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Midianuüa nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Akung kowi dow Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup ta plan chang khai iawk. Amatni dow Baal thuraiuüa hai Astarte thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia büah khai. Nami klen kowi Siriauüa kowh thuraiuüa, Sidawnuüa kowh thuraiuüa, Moabuüa kowh thuraiuüa, Amawnuüa kowh thuraiuüa hai Filistinuüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia büah khai. Naiawng hai Israeluüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowi nuata khai, now aia kowi chupiia büah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa luk kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai. Now amatni kowi mih Filistinuüa hai Amawnuüa rut kowi ap-ah khai. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Nami ning kowi amatni dow Israeluüa kowi uown changah anowng apowng khai. Amatni dow Jawrdan aw satlawt prakowi kowh Amawruüa kowh pren Gilead süng kowi kowh uowi mih Israeluüa kowi 18 ning mowr towkah ngare büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Now Amawnuüa dow satkup pra kowh uowi mih Juda krungchakuüa, Benjamin krungchakuüa hai Efraim krungchakuüa kowi nauang senah kownkow uaipown Jawrdan aw khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih lainowmma pusa khai. <verse eid="JDG 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar se tek pe mih, “Anging changta ngak khai nowm. Anging dow anging kowh Thurai kowi nuata hanow Baal thuraiuüa kowi cham chupiia khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Aiguptauüa hownia, Amawruüa hownia, Amawnuüa hownia hai Filistinuüa hownia ang lawng enni dowi bow? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Sidawnuüa, Amalekuüa hai Maawnuüa chang enni anowng apowng khe kar se ang tut-e enni awr lü khowng khai. Nakhowk khe paw naiawngünuüa rut hownia ang lawng enni khai. <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Nachenganchepaw enni mih nuata ang khai, now akeng thuraiuüa kowi enni cham chupiia khai. Naiawng rakowi ang nalawng enni kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Enni lang kloah mih thuraiuüa tut-e phai kowkowi now kowkar büah. Enni kla phih mih khin khe amatni pacham lawng enni lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Anging changta angak khai. En nau iawng chang anging towbowt. Nachenganchepaw sakrauma hown khaleng dow lawng anging akatchow diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa rup uowi mih maten kuakta büah khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia büah khai bowt. Israeluüa kowh krat pusa khita hanow CHAKRAMANG mih saktuak tawi kawm khai.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Amawnuüa dow cham dowk tasen kownkow takua talawm khai bowt, now amatni dow Gilead süng kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. Now Israeluüa paw takua talawm hanow Gilead süng kowi kowh Mizpa marow kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Gileaduüa kowh aluchowuüa tatek mih, “Amawnuüa kowi nakowsen kownkow mia chow narik tarowngla a-i kown? Nami maru dow a-i Gileaduüa kowh kruitown miia nachowng kown,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Jeftha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Nami khin khe Gilead kowi kowh Jeftha dow tasen akiakma chekhai. Jeftha kowh u dow <char style="w">chawkkrawma</char> chekhai, now a-pa ming dow Gilead chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Gilead kowh masi mih ka chapa sangrum khai. Now naiawngün chauüa awr iuk kung kowi Jeftha kowi prütta hanow tek pe mih, “Anging kimchak kowh dawngthawnguan bak en natawi ka kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow akeng mih masiuüa kowh chah chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Naiawng rakowi Jeftha dow atainau-uüa hownia powt now Tawb pren kowi kowuowi khai. Nakowi uowi khe aia dow maru ngakuüa kowi kuaah lawmah hanow chowng aluchow khai.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4-5" />Naiawng Jeftha cham uowi pre sum ning kung kowi Israeluüa kowi Amawnuüa uang senah khai. Nakhowk khe dow Gilead süng kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa mih Tawb pren kowi kowh cham uowi mih Jeftha kowi kowkrawi hawah khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Jeftha kowi tek pe büah mih, “Amawnuüa hown anging tasen kown. Naiawng rakowi en mih uang tawi chowng anging kowh siphai aluchow diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Nakhowk khe Jeftha klangah mih, “Enni sui ang kowh apa kim hownia enni prüt ang mih chowbowt nadowi bow? Kawmat dow enni kla phih now tawngplawng kowchow ang tut-e enni uang khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Now aluchowuüa tek pe iawk mih, “Anging prütta en khowk chepaw kawmat dow anging uang plan paw en iawk mih chowbowt. Anging hown uang tawi now Amawnuüa hown uang tawi dowk tasen diah. Nahanow Gilead kowi kowh anging uowi mih maten luk kowi en nachowng aluchow kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Nakhowk khe Jeftha tek pe mih, “Laiuan kowi, Amawnuüa hown tasen kownkow enni hown ang tawi now ang tawi tasen khai, now CHAKRAMANG paw Amawnuüa kowi ang rut kowi apta ang khai. Naiawng e dow nakhowk khe enni kowh aluchow enni pe chowng ang nowm kown bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Nakhowk khe aluchowuüa klangah mih, “En tek iawng anging chang en kown taih. Nami lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG mih a-i kowh saksi pana lah,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Naiawng hai Jeftha dow Gilead kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hown kowtawi khai. Now maru-uüa dow Jeftha kowi amatni kowh aluchow hai siphai aluchow thawpah khai. Aia dow Mizpa kowi kowkowiah now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aluchowuüa hown kowh aia takham mih laiklow maten kowtek khai.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Jeftha mih Amawnuüa kowh mang tut-e kowchin maru khai. Now aia krawi lüntaah mih, “Tawng rakowi chow en uang tuk sen anging khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Jeftha kowchinah mih maru-uüa kowi Amawnuüa kowh mang krawi tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt now enni Israeluüa mih Jawrdan aw ria kowi kowh Arnawn aw hownia Jawrdan aw ria rowkrowk panow Jabawk aw mowr ang kowh süng maten enni powngta ang khai. Kawmat mih naiawngün süng maten aiungma hown planta anging diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14-15" />Amawnuüa kowh mang tut-e Jeftha krawi plan chin pe maru hanow krawi tek pe iawk mih, “Anging Israeluüa mih Moab pren paw powngta dowi, now Amawnuüa kowh pren paw anging powngta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 11:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt kung kowi anging Israeluüa mih süngrüp süngkangma iawng panow sata Rik mowr kowkowi khai, now nami kung kowi dow Kades marow kowi anging kowkowi khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Nami kung kowi Edawmuüa kowh mang tut-e kowchin maru now anging tek pe mih, ‘En kowh pren iawng pe mang anging diah,’ pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Edawmuüa kowh mang mih anging kowh laiklow nauta dowi. Now Moabuüa kowh mang tut-e paw anging kowchin maru now aia pren iawng pe mang anging kown mih laiklow anging kowtek pe khai. Nachenganchepaw Moabuüa kowh mang paw anging kowh laiklow nauta dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi anging Israeluüa mih Kades marow kowi anging hing uowi khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Nami kung kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng panow Edawmuüa hai Moabuüa kowh pren riala khai, now Moab pren satlawt pra iawng panow Arnawn aw paipra pown kowi anging kowkhup tangbung khai. Nakhowk khe Moab pren kowi anging Israeluüa kupla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Arnawn aw dow Moab pren sünghi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />“Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Hesbawn marow kowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun tut-e kowchin maru khai. Now kowtek pe mih, ‘Anging pren kowi nakowkowi kownkow en pren iawng pe mang anging diah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Nachenganchepaw mang Sihun mih owm anging dowi chekhai. Aia dow aia pren iawng pe mang anging dowi. Pe mang anging lak dow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi kuaah now Jahaz marow kowi uang khup tangbung khai, now uang sen anging khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih Sihun hai aia kowh maru maten kowi anging rut kowi ap-ah khai, now amatni kowi dow anging nowngta khai. Now Amawruüa kowh süng maten anging powngta pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Arnawn aw hownia Jabawk aw mowr, now süngrüp süngkangma hownia Jawrdan aw mowr Amawruüa kowh süng maten anging powngta pe khai.<verse eid="JDG 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />“Amawruüa kowi prütta now amatni kowh süng CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai pe anging khowk mih napowngta kownkow mia chow pe en alow? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />En kowh Kemaws thurai pe en mih süng maten en powngta bowk nadowi bow? Nami iawng dow anging paw anging pur hownia CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai prütah mih chenchapuüa kowh süng maten anging powngta mih chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Moab pren mang Zipawr kowh chapa Balak lak-e en lang iung khai bow? Aia dow Israeluüa hown katpaw taran dowi, now tasen paw tasen dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Anging Israeluüa krawi uowi mih dow Hesbawn hai Aroer marow kowi chekhai, now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua hai Arnawn aw ret kowi kowh kua maten kowi paw anging krawi uowi khai. Naiawngün kowi anging krawi uowi mih dow ani mowr kowi 300 ning khowk chekhai. Nami 300 ning takra kowi naiawngün süng naka kownkow tawngplawng kowchow tawngpaw en chang dowi? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Nami lawnguan kowi dow en luk kowi ang changta angak mih mapaw uowi dowi chekhai. En sen ang mih tarapdow ang luk kowi en changta angak mih chekhai. Tara chet miia CHAKRAMANG dow anging Israeluüa hai enni Amawnuüa luk kowi pacham chet a-i tara lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Nachenganchepaw Jeftha kowchinah mih maru kowh laiklow Amawnuüa kowh mang dow sünta pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeftha takhamta rakowi achama kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla mih Jeftha kowi uang kruitownah khai. Nahanow Jeftha dow Gilead hai Manase krungchakuüa kowh süng iawng kowkowiah now Gileaduüa süng kowi kowh Mizpa marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now nami hownia Amawnuüa kowi dowkah tasen khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30-31" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tut-e Jeftha takham mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, Amawnuüa kowi che ang rut kowi en ap ang khai hanow Amawnuüa kowi nowngta kung kowi ang uang plan khe uang hawt chum ang mih maru dow en vüi naown kown. Nami maru hown dow tikah mih uanap ang nachangla kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Nami kung kowi dow Jeftha mih Amawnuüa hown kowtasen khai bowt, now CHAKRAMANG mih Amawnuüa kowi dow aia rut kowi ap pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Jeftha hai aia kowh siphai hawmh mih Aroer marow hai Minit marow takra kowi kowh uowi mih 20 marow dow piakta khai. Nami klen kowi alakma kowi kowh uowi mih Abel-Keramim marow paw piakta khai. Naiawng hai Israeluüa dow Amawnuüa kowi senah now nowngta khai.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Now Mizpa kowi kowh aia kim kowi Jeftha uang plan khe aia kowi hawt chumah mih dow aia kowh chama lowkchow mih chekhai. Aia kowh chama dow sawkchow tün hown plaila nüklük se aia kowi uang hawt chumah khai. Jeftha kowh dow nami lowk iachow klen kowi tawng iawng mih chama chapa paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Jeftha dow achama uang hawt chumah mih khita now aia kowh tawnguat sekah khai. Now aia tek mih, “Aw tum ow! Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang ang khai. En pe kla ang phih khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang khamta mih dow mapaw ang ia piak dowi bowt chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Nakhowk khe Jeftha kowi achama klangah mih, “Apa, CHAKRAMANG dow en kowh ransu Amawnuüa luk kowi pe awng en khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e en khamta lai khai bowt chedow en kowh laikham kowi uowi iawng chang ang diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Nami klen kowi achama plan tek pe mih, “Tawkchedow ang kowh laiklow en chün ang lowk kown takla. Ang dow tawi ka changla dawngthawng dowi bowt hai tawi ka kumla nau dowi bowt chedow hungh towng cham krawi mang panglang se ang auiuauüa hown kar hai nguk hown nauowi kownkow en pe ang akhin pre la kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Naiawng rakowi Jeftha mih achama kowi peah akhin pre la khai. Nakhowk khe Jeftha chama dow akeng mih malauüa hawmh hown hungh towng cham krawi len hanow <char style="w">uowila uiting uangtak</char> khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow tawi ka kumla nau dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Now pre la chur kung kowi dow aia mih a-pa tut-e uang plan uang khai bowt. Now Jeftha dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e aia khamta lai iawng achama luk kowi changah khai. Achama dow malauüa reng tak khe kowng takla khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Naiawng phaw hownia bowt now Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi mih ari sar thawpah büah lowk khai. <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Amatni dow Jeftha kowh chama kowi natukla reng kownkow ning towng tali ni chi Israel malauüa hawmh mih kowmatia kim hownia cham lawt hanow uowila uiting uangtak khai.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Jeftha hai Efraimuüa tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Akung kowi Efraim krungchakuüa mih amatni kowh siphai hawmh kowi hawah khai. Now amatni mih haipown Jawrdan aw hanow Zafawn marow kowi kowkowi büah khai. Nakowi amatni tek pe Jeftha mih, “Amawnuüa hown tasen khe tawngplawng kowchow en hawla anging dowi? En hailawm en kowh kim mih anging natowkta en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi Jeftha tek pe mih, “Amawnuüa hown ang hai ang kowh maru-uüa lainowmma pusa mih khin khe uang khowng ang kown mih ang haw enni khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Amawnuüa rut hownia enni uang lawng ang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Enni uang khowng ang dowi tham pami ang tuk hanow ang dow singsing kowngkowng Amawnuüa hown kowtasen khai. Now CHAKRAMANG tawi khowng ang rakowi amatni kowi mih ang nowngta khai. Kawmat tawngplawng kowchow ang hown tasen kownkow enni uang tuk uang khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Nami kung kowi dow Jeftha mih Gilead kowi kowh maru-uüa maten kowi kuala now Efraimuüa hown kowtasen khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Efraim krungchakuüa tek mih, “Aw Gileaduüa, enni dow Efraim hai Manase krungchakuüa hownia kowh cham powt mih maru chekhai,” pakhai. Nami tasen kowi Gileaduüa dow Efraimuüa kowi nowngta khai. <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Now Gileaduüa dow Efraim süng prakowi haimangla kown mih Jawrdan aw khawk hown nowng pownah mih arah maten krawi powngta pe khai. Ta sing uowi mih Efraim krungchakuüa mih, “Pe pown ang aw diah,” pahai tek mih khin khe Gileaduüa dow aia kowi lüntaah mih, “En Efraim maru bow?” pakhai. Aia che, “Ang Efraim maru nadowi,” pahai tek khai hanow <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />amatni tek pe mih, “‘Shibbawlet,’ pahai tek madiah,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe aia che klangiungma tuk tek dowi kowh “Sebbawlet” pahai tek khai hanow amatni dow naiawng mih maru kowi Jawrdan aw pown rah re-e hing saita büah khai. Nami khin khe amatni dow Efraimuüa kowi 42,000 ia hawt saita khai.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Israeluüa kowi mih taruk ning mowr Jeftha kruitownla khai. Aia dow Gilead krungchak chekhai. Aia kowng hanow aia kowi dow Gileaduüa süng kowi kowh marow kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Ibzan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Jeftha kowng kung kowi dow Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Ibzan chekhai. Aia dow Bethlehem marow kowi kowh uowi mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Ibzan kowh dow chapa uowi 30 ia, now achama paw uowi 30 ia chekhai. Aia dow achamauüa kowi akeng chen kowi cham pe mangah khai, now achapauüa kowh masi paw akeng chen malauüa kowi cham paw pe khai. Aia dow ranit ning mowr Israeluüa kowi kruitownla khai. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Ibzan kowng hanow aia kowi dow Bethlehem marow kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Elawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Ibzan kowng kung kowi dow hamüt ning mowr Israeluüa kowi Elawn kruitownla khai. Aia dow Zebulun krungchak chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Aia kowng hanow aia kowi dow Zebulun süng kowi uowi mih Aijalawn marow kowi dupah khai.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Abdawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Elawn kowng kung kowi dow Israeluüa kowh tara chet mih Hilel kowh chapa Abdawn chekhai. Aia dow Pirathawn marow kowi kowh uowi mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Aia kowh dow chapa uowi 40 ia, now chu uowi 30 ia chekhai. Achapa hai achu-uüa kowh dow lowk ia e lowk chi kawrngaramchük uowi bowk chekhai. Abdawn dow Israeluüa kowi raiat ning mowr kruitownla khai. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Aia kowng hanow aia kowi dow Pirathawn kua kowi dupah khai. Pirathawn kua uowi mih dow Amalekuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi Efraimuüa kowh süng kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Simsawn dia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup plan chang khai iawk. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih 40 ning mowr amatni kowi Filistinuüa nimkrüa kowi towah khai.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Nami khin khe Zora marow kowi Manoa pami maru uowi lowk ia. Aia dow Dan krungchak chekhai. Amasi dow atingma rakowi katpaw ka chah dowi. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Akat khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih Manoa kowh masi tut-e uang tatüng khai. Now tek pe mih, “En dow atingma rakowi ka chah dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en nakum nau hanow en naka kachakuüa chah lowk ia kown. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Tawkchedow kaneuma en nauowi kown takla. Grep tui lah, arak lah, asür alawkma mih chap ün en naia cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />En nakaah kown mih chapa kowi katpaw en nakep pe sam kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow uang dia krowngchow hownia aia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi nachowng <char style="w">Nazaret</char> kown mih chekhai. Aia dow Filistinuüa rut hownia Israeluüa kowi nalawngah kown mih lup nauown chang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Nakhowk khe nami masiuüa dow ahua tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe mih, “Ang tut-e Thurai maru uang lowk ia. Aia kowh powm dow Thurai kowh kramamu powm iawng; aia kowi khi now lainowmma kramra uowi. Tawkchedow tawng hownia chow aia uang mih ang lüntaah dowi, now aia paw aia kowh ming tek ang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Aia tek ang mih, ‘En nakum nau hanow en naka kachakuüa chah lowk ia kown. Naiawng rakowi kawmat hownia grep tui lah, arak lah, asür alawkma mih chap lah en naia cha naia kham kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow uang dia krowngchow hownia kowng dowi mowr aia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi nachowng Nazaret kown mih chekhai,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Nami laiklow tata now Manoa mih maiawng CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü khai, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, en uang chin angching mih Thurai maru kowi sakrauma hown uang chin angching iawk diah. Angching nakaah kown mih chah kowi tawng iawng chow achang takla mih aia dow pauang sang angching lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Thurai dow Manoa awr lü mih sünta pe khai, now Thurai kowh kramamu dow Manoa masi tut-e uang plan uang khai iawk. Thurai kowh kramamu uang khe aia dow dowm kowi chowm phülü khai. Tawkchedow nami khin khe ahua Manoa mih aia re-e tawi uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow lenlenma kowkowiah now ahua kowi kowtek pe mih, “Mani nani khe kowh ang tut-e uang mih maru uang iawk khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Manoa mih amasi hown kowtawi khai. Now kramamu re-e kowtatawnah hanow tek pe mih, “Ang masi kowi kowh uang klangah mih en chowbowt bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Nakhowk khe kramamu klangah mih, “Ow, ang chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Manoa lüntaah mih, “En tekah iawng uang phaw mih khin khe tawng iawng chow nami chah nauowi kown takla, now aia kowh lup dow tawng chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu klangah mih, “En masi kowi ang tek pe mih srui pacham chünah kaneu lah. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Grep ruih hownia kowh phaw mih chap maten tawngpaw aia mih naia cha kown nadowi. Grep tui, arak hai asür alawkma mih chap matiow aia mih naia cha naia kham kown nadowi. Aia kowi ang peah mih ana maten aia nachün kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu kowi Manoa tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hai uowi nawng diah ba. Angching ngen en rua chah lowk tak; chala hawm kan diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu klangah mih, “Enching town ang chepaw enching kowh chakkham ang nacha enching kown nadowi. Nachenganchepaw enching che nau hanow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap phai chang iüa diah,” pape khai. Nami maru dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu chekhai pami Manoa hing tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu kowi Manoa lüntaah mih, “En ming mia chow? En tekah iawng uang phaw mih khin khe angching natüng en ringkawra kown nau,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu klangah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk lünta ang ming khai? Ang kowh ming dow awdara uowima; tek en chepaw en tukta dowi tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Nakhowk khe Manoa mih rua chah hown akeng mih kawmdi uanap pawla now huaklu luk kowi tangah khai. Now naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG kowi aia phuchuala khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu dow Manoa iüah huaiu kowi tüng pe awdara lup lowk khai. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Phuchuara kowi kowh maih lün bia laplap mih hown CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu paw kuang prakowi awr tawi pün khai. Naiawng phaw mih khita now Manoa iüah huaiu mih krawng kowi tabawk krawm se chupah khai.<verse eid="JDG 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Now nami maru dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu chowbowt pami Manoa tuk khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih amatchi tut-e uang tatüng dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Nakhowk khe amasi kowi Manoa tek pe mih, “Thurai kowi achi khi khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi achi dow nakowng ngengche kown chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Nakhowk khe amasi klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG che saita achi kown nau e dow tikah mih uanap hai kawmdi uanap paw achi kown bow? Now awdara lup ün natüng achi kown bow? Nami klen kowi achi luk kowi nauang ting kown mih laiklow paw natek achi kown bow?” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Nami kung kowi dow Manoa masi mih ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai, now aming dow Simsawn pahai rük pe khai. Simsawn dow awr iuk khai, now aia kowi dow Thurai peah prasi khai. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Zora hai Estaawl marow takra kowi kowh Mahane-Dan pami arah kowi uowi khe Simsawn kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla mih uang peah kür khai bowt.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Simsawn kowh masi pawk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Akung kowi Simsawn mih Timna marow kowi kowkowi khai, now nakowi kowh Filistin malauüa lowk ia kowi aia naukhita khai. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Aia dow Timna hownia uang mang now a-u a-pa kowi tek pe mih, “Timna marow kowi kowh Filistin malauüa kowi ang naukhila lowk ia. Paimi malauüa kowi phai kowlo ang iüah; ang changla masi kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Nakhowk khe a-u a-pa klangah mih, “A-i tasin taken miuüa pungmadawng kowi hai a-i Israel chen pachenma dawng kowi masiuüa uowi dowi chekhai bow? Tawngplawng kowchow hiah <char style="w">khampha uanpik</char> dowi mih Filistinuüa kowh chama kowi en tuk naukhi khai?” pape khai. Nachenganchepaw Simsawn tek pe mih, “Paimi masiuüa kowi taih ang naukhi. Paimi masiuüa kowi kowlo ang iüah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Nami dow Filistinuüa hown pacham tasen lah pakowh CHAKRAMANG uang pe phawah mih chekhai. (Nami khin khe Israeluüa kowi kruitownah mih dow Filistinuüa chekhai). Nachenganchepaw naiawng phaw mih dow CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh chekhai pami a-u a-pa iüah hing tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Akung kowi Simsawn mih a-u a-pa hown Timna marow kowi kowkowi khai. Amatni mih Timna marow re-e kowh grep krum kowi kowting kown chowbowt khe krangsila powrchow changla ran sulu se Simsawn prakowi uang haimang khai. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Nakhowk khe aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla uang peah kür hanow aia mih akürma uang phaw khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami krangsi kowi rua chah kowi kowh iaita nak mih iawng rut khawma hown aia iaita nak khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawng aia chang mih a-u a-pa kowi aia tek pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Akung kowi aia mih nami malauüa tut-e kowkowiah now kowtalawp khai, now nami malauüa kowi mih aia sak ta-ih klowk chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Now pre sum ni kung kowi amatni dow nami masiuüa kowi nakowlo kownkow Timna marow kowi kowkowi khai bowt. Amatni kowtarü khe tiama ria kowi kowh krangsi uak nakowmüla kownkow Simsawn mih ta takleng khai. Now aia dow nami krangsi uak raw kowi kuaiba kowi kuai prum hulu mih khita khai. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Nami kuaiba dow pre rut pre pra aia dowkah now chala kuai tui se aia mang khai. Now a-u a-pa kowi paw nami kuai tui aia pela ne khai, now a-u a-pa paw nami kuai tui tawi cha khai. Nachenganchepaw nami kuai tui mih krangsi uak hownia kowh aia pawah mih pami a-u a-pa kowi aia tek pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Now Simsawn pa mih sutawng chang lawnguan kowi natalawp kownkow masiuüa kim kowi kowkowi khai bowt. Nami khin khe Simsawn mih rirow kowi uowi iawng nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi chang pe pawi khai. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Simsawn kowi khita now Filistinuüa mih Simsawn kowi naiuala kownkow uang pawla pe klanguüa 30 ia khai.<verse eid="JDG 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Nami klanguüa hawmh kowi Simsawn tek pe mih, “Ang aw enni lowk tak. Mami pawi ranit ni kowi nami ta-aw uan che enni nowng phuang khai hanow adipükchow mih la hown kowh uanchow akhup chi, now kowrmow hai klowngkrua dawngh atheng chi ang nape enni kown. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Tawkchedow enni che nami auan enni nowng phuang dowi hanow lowk ia e adipükchow mih la hown kowh kawngah mih kowrmow thawng lowk chi, now iawngpa mih kowrmow hai klowngkrua dawngh atheng chi enni nape ang kown takla,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Nakhowk khe klanguüa hawmh tek pe mih, “En kowh ta-aw lai sam tek madiah, anging süntaah matak,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Simsawn tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">“Achak miia hownia chakkham uang lawt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:14">now akürma mih hownia ading uang lawt khai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:14">Nami ta-aw lai dow sum ni mowr mih nowng phuang büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Tali ni mih ni khe dow Simsawn masi tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe büah mih, “En hua kowi kuanah hanow ta-aw lai uan lüntaah madiah, now phuang anging dit. Nadowi now en hai en pa kimchak maten kowi anging natowk enni kown. En hawla anging pawi chak mih en pe ngarai anging kownkow bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Nakhowk khe Simsawn masi mih kar hülü se Simsawn kowi tek pe mih, “Mapaw en sakrau ang dowi; sui taih en sui ang. Ang maru-uüa kowi en awah khai. Tawkchedow nami auan en phuangla ang dowi,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Simsawn klangah mih, “A-u apa kowi khowm padow nami auan ang phuang pe dowi pache en kowi tak ü ang phuang en kown?” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Now pawi chur ni mowr amasi dow ahua tut-e kar hülü khai. Naiawng amasi kamcheah lai bowt rakowi achur khe dow nami ta-aw uan mih amasi kowi Simsawn phuangta pe khai. Nahanow amasi mih aia maru-uüa kowi nami ta-aw uan dow phuang pe khai.<verse eid="JDG 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Ranit ni mih ni khe dow sat kup dowi rawn nami kuachak maru-uüa tek pe Simsawn mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 14:18" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Kuai tui lak-e tawng chow lang ding?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">Krangsi lak-e tawng chow lang kür?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 14:18" />
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Nakhowk khe Simsawn klangah mih, “Ang matia kowh chia iia hown enni thawn laih dowi panü dow nami ta-aw lai uan enni nowng phuang kown nadowi diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Nami kung kowi dow aia luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla uang ting hanow aia dow akürma uang phaw khai. Aia dow Askelawn kowi kowkowiah now nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi kowsaita 30 ia khai. Now naiawngün maru-uüa kowh tawnguat hai uowi mih srui aia pawla pe khai. Now naiawngün tawnguat dow aia awah miuüa kowi aia peah khai. Nami kung kowi aia dow tawmpa kunmarau hown u-pa kim kowi mang khai. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh masi kowi dow a-pu a-piuüa mih aia kowh auiua 30 ia pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia hown ta pe tachawngah khai.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowi Simsawn sat pe klai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Akung kowi püm ngen khin khe pawla rua chah apum hanow Simsawn mih kowmü amasi khai. Amasi kim kowi kowting khe Simsawn tek pe a-pu mih, “Ang masi kim lak kowi ang kowkup kown chaw,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow amasi kim lak kowi a-pu pe kupah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />A-pu tek pe mih, “Ang ka tuak mih ang chama kowi en sui mih nowm khowk snü. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow iuala en mih en auiua lowk ia mih hown ang pe tachawngta tüng khowk. Nachenganchepaw anaumow uowi lowk ia tak. Anaumow dow aia lak-e lang klangiung. Anaumow kowi en paw towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Nakhowk khe Simsawn tek mih, “Khaleng dow Filistinuüa kowi ang piakah chepaw ang kowh aprek nauowi kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Naiawng tekla kung kowi lawt hanow aia dow cham khüm brenkhui 300 pum khai. Now naiawngün brenkhui maten kowi achum achumchow amai lala sükah now adawnglang kowi aia tap pe maitawng lowk chi khai. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Nami kung kowi dow maitawng maten kowi chan pe maih now Filistinuüa kowh laih kowi aia lawtta pe iua khai. Nami maih dow Filistinuüa kowh cha ngen ia hown ngenah dowi tak mih cha hai kanrawn khang ün kamta pe bowk khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Nami khita now Filistinuüa tek mih, “Naiawng mih lup mia chow chang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:6">Nakhowk khe maru tek pe mih, “Timna kowh mawkchow Simsawn tiah naiawng chang. Amasi kowi a-auiua hown a-pu pe tachawngta tüng kowh chowbowt naiawng Simsawn chang mih,” pakhai. Nami tata hanow Filistinuüa mih Simsawn masi hai a-pu kowi maih kowi nawmah khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Nakhowk khe Simsawn tek pe mih, “Naiawng enni chang mih klai ang sat enni dowi kowi mapaw ang nalawt enni kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Now Simsawn mih mapaw sanaah dowi kowi Filistinuüa kowi krawi saiah khai, now Filistinuüa dow akawmma kowng khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih Etam huamang kowi kowh puk kowi kowtapet khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Nakhowk khe Filistinuüa mih uangah now Juda krungchakuüa kowh süng kowi uang khup tangbung khai, now Lehi marow kowi rumah büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Nakhowk khe Juda krungchakuüa lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow nasen anging kownkow enni uang tuk uang khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Now Filistinuüa klangah mih, “Simsawn kowi khümla now napawla kownkow anging uang mih taih. Aia chang anging iawng aia luk kowi paw anging nachangah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Nakhowk khe Juda krungchak hownia maru iun 3,000 ia mih Etam huamang kowi kowh puk re-e kowkowi khai. Now Simsawn kowi kowtek pe büah mih, “Filistinuüa nimkrüa kowi a-i uowi mih en tuk dowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang anging khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Nakhowk khe Simsawn klangah mih, “Amatni chang ang iawng amatni kowi ang changah mih taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Nakhowk khe kowbüah tek pe Simsawn mih, “Natawmla en hanow Filistinuüa tut-e napawla en kownkow anging uang mih chaw,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Now Simsawn klangah mih, “Naiawng now enni matia sai ang dowi kown mih ang tut-e rik kham sawi büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Nakhowk khe Simsawn kowi kowbüah klangah mih, “Mapaw anging sai en dowi tham; natawmla en hanow Filistinuüa rut kowi anging naap en krowngchow kown taih,” pakhai. Naiawng ki tatek büah kung kowi dow leng sar pre buk hown Simsawn kowi tawmah büah khai, now puk hownia iu dowmla büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Now Lehi marow re-e kowting büah khe Filistinuüa mih howla sawmlawm se Simsawn prakowi uang haimang khai. Nami khin khe Simsawn luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla mih uang ting hanow Simsawn dow akürma uang phaw khai. Nahanow aia bawng kowi kowh tawmla mih leng dow chida kam khe kowh iawng abün chow uang phaw hanow dowh khai. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Nami khin khe aia dow kawrngaramchük kammow hut ka lowk khai. Nami kammow hut hown aia dow maru iun 1,000 ia kowi saita khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Nakhowk khe Simsawn mih maiawng tek meng khai,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 15:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kawrngaramchük kammow lowk hown amatni kowi dow amawngma ang changah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">kawrngaramchük kammow lowk hown athawng aiawng maru kowng khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Naiawng ki tek meng kung kowi kawrngaramchük kammow dow aia kuakta khai. Now nami re-e kowh arah ming dow Ramat Lehi pahai aia chap pe khai. Nami auan dow “Kammow Hungh” pami chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Nami kung kowi dow Simsawn mih lainowmma tui sakkrai khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow chup Thurai khai. Aia tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, en nar kowi awngra iukma en peah khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow tui sakkrai hown maiawngün hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih chenchap tut-e ang kowng natakla kown chekhai bow?” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG mih Lehi marow re-e iu uow pe tuikuam lowk khai, now nami tuikuam hownia mih tui uang lawt iualua khai. Nami tui khamta hanow Simsawn dow plan ka kür khai iawk. Naiawng rakowi nami tuikuam ming dow En-Hakawre pahai aia chap pe khai. Nami auan dow “Chup Thurai mih kowh Tuikuam” pami chekhai. Nami tuikuam dow kawmat paw Lehi marow kowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Filistinuüa nimkrüa kowi uowi büah mih khin khe 20 ning mowr amatni Israeluüa kowi Simsawn kruitownah khai.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Simsawn bur Gaza marow tapplawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Akat khe Simsawn dow Filistinuüa kowh Gaza marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now nakowi dow aia mih chawkkrawma lowk ia hown takrum khai, now nami chawkkrawma hown aia dow kowtaphua taiua khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Now nakowi Simsawn uang mih Gaza marowchakuüa tukta khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow tapat lut now marow mih rumah büah khai, now amatni dow uar prowt marow tapplawt kowi hawt pawm Simsawn khai. Amatni dow uar prowt ririmma uowi büah khai. Amatni tatek mih, “Uar thowi now Simsawn kowi a-i saita kown,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Nachenganchepaw Simsawn dow nakowi mih uar dawnglang mowr uowila now powt khai. Aia dow marow tapplawt kowi kowh aklia müa lawng hailawm <char style="w">achüng</char> pre buk mih hai tap büng mih burla khai. Now aia dow naiawngün kawtla hanow Hebrawn marow hown atawnchow mih hungh chut kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simsawn hai Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Akung kowi dow Simsawn mih Sorek lawngrawi kowi kowh uowi mih masiuüa lowk ia kowi naukhita khai. Nami masiuüa ming dow Delila chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Filistinuüa kowh tara chet miuüa dow nami masiuüa tut-e kowkowi now tek pe mih, “Simsawn kowi kuanah diah. Aia kowh kür kraingma mih lawnguan kowi lüntaah madiah, now tawng iawng chow tawmah e aia kowh kür nauowi dowi kown mih lüntaah madiah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi towkah ngare kown anging nau chekhai. Anging tek iawng che en chang now lowk ia e tai 1,100 iun chi anging nape en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Nahanow Delila tek pe Simsawn mih, “En kowh kür kraingma mih lawnguan hai tawng iawng chow tawm en e en kowh kür nauowi dowi kown mih sakrauma hown tek ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Simsawn tek pe mih, “Chawpla salangba mih leng sar keu dowi tak mih ranit rüa hown tawm ang now akeng mih maru-uüa iawng ang kowh kür naiaw kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Now Filistinuüa kowh aluchowuüa dow salangba leng sar keu dowi tak mih Delila kowi uang peah ranit rüa khai. Now Delila mih naiawngün leng hown Simsawn kowi tawmah khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Nami dowi rawn khe Delila mih aia kowh towklak kowi Filistinuüa kowi hawt pe pawmah sangrum khai. Now Delila tek pe Simsawn mih, “Simsawn! Filistinuüa uang khüm en khowk,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe Simsawn dow naiawngün leng mih lasin iang kowi maih kam khe kowh tarai iawng raita bun khai. Naiawng hai Filistinuüa dow Simsawn kür mih uan tuk büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Nami kung kowi Delila tek pe Simsawn mih, “En kuan ang khai. En dai ang khai. Tawng hown chow naia tawm en kown mih khaleng dow achingchow tek ang diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Simsawn tek pe mih, “Katpaw tawngah dowi tak mih leng sar hown tawm ang now akeng mih maru-uüa iawng ang kowh kür naiaw kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Naiawng rakowi Delila mih paw leng sangrum hanow Simsawn kowi tawmah khai. Nami dowi rawn khe aia mih aia kowh towklak kowi Filistinuüa kowi hawt pe pawmah sangrum khai. Now Delila tek pe Simsawn mih, “Simsawn! Filistinuüa uang khüm en khowk!” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Simsawn dow naiawngün leng mih lasin iang iawng raita prowt khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila tek pe Simsawn mih, “Kawmat mowr kowi dai lai hown en kuan ang rengreng tak. Tawng hown chow naia tawm en kown mih achingchow tek ang diah!” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Simsawn tek pe mih, “Ang kowh ranit te mih sam dow powk powng kowi kawngla diah. Now nami powk powng dow chung hown asima cham uowkah diah. Nahanow akeng mih maru-uüa iawng ang kowh kür naiaw kown taih,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Nahanow Delila mih Simsawn kowh sam powk powng kowi kawngla khai bowt. Now nami powk powng dow chung hown cham uowkah khai. Now Delila tek pe Simsawn mih, “Simsawn! Filistinuüa uang khüm en khowk!” pape khai. Nachenganchepaw Simsawn dow awr rü hanow nami chung hai powk powng mih awr thükta bowk khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila tek pe aia mih, “Mapaw en tuak ang dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en naukhi ang pami tawng iawng chow en tuk tek ang khai? Mami hown en kuan ang sum kat khowk. En kowh kür kraingma mih lawnguan en tek ang dowi,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Naiawng hai Delila dow nami laiklow mih ni towng tiamaliama Simsawn kowi lüntaah khai. Naiawng rakowi Simsawn mih lainowmma pusa khai bowt.<verse eid="JDG 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow Delila kowi lawpta pe bowk khai. Aia tek pe mih, “Ang dow katpaw kep sam dowi tak chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow uang dia hownia ang dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chowng Nazaret mih chekhai. Ang che kepta sam hanow ang kowh kür napowt kown towbowt. Nahanow akeng mih maru-uüa iawng ang mih kür naiaw kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Now nami leng dow aia kowi achingchow Simsawn tek pe bowk mih chowbowt padow Delila ka tuak khai bowt. Nahanow aia dow Filistinuüa kowh aluchowuüa kowi krawi pe satang mih, “Uang plan uang büah akatchow diah. Aia dow achingchow tekta ang bowk khowk,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Filistinuüa kowh aluchowuüa mih tai tangka pawla now aia tut-e uang khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Delila dow aia thung luk kowi Simsawn kowi pe müiah khai. Now Simsawn kowh ranit te mih sam dow maru lowk ia kowi Delila pe kepah khai, now Simsawn kowh dow kür powt khai bowt. Nakhowk khe aia dow Simsawn kowi toah khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Nami kung kowi Delila tek pe Simsawn mih, “Simsawn! Filistinuüa uang khüm en khowk!” pakhai. Now Simsawn dow awr rü müi khai, now aia dow auown khe kowh iawng naia talawng kown taih padow tatuak khai. Tawkche aia kowi CHAKRAMANG powtta pe mih aia hing tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Nahanow Filistinuüa dow aia kowi khümla hanow mik pre buk trui laita pe khai, now Gaza marow kowi pawla khai. Aia kowi dow kri leng hown tawmah büah khai, now thawngrum lak kowi kowh kawm küa mih lup pe changah khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh sam dow uang plan awm khai iawk.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simsawn kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Nami kung kowi dow Filistinuüa kowh aluchowuüa mih amatni kowh Dagawn thurai vüi kowi nachang phuchua kownkow hai napiaw kownkow arasang takua talawm büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni tek mih, “A-i kowh thurai dow a-i kowh ransu Simsawn kowi a-i rut kowi apta a-i khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Filistinuüa mih khita Simsawn hanow amatni kowh thurai kowi kiow büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni tek mih, “A-i kowh thurai dow a-i kowh ransu Simsawn kowi a-i rut kowi apta a-i khai; Simsawn dow a-i kowh laih ün piakta a-i khai, now a-i kowh maru-uüa kowi paw saita mih ahuma khowk chekhai,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih piaw se maiawng hai how sawmlawm khai, “Simsawn kowi uang lawtla diah. Aia kowi anging müah tamasa kown,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow thawngrum hownia Simsawn kowi uang lawtla khai, now amatni dow Simsawn kowi changla tamasa khai bowt. Amatni dow kimchüng takra kowi Simsawn kowi pe iowngah khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Aia kowi dowk pe rut mih klanguüa kowi Simsawn tek pe mih, “Ang tane kown nau; thurai kim kowi kowh kimchüng kowi pe kak ang diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Nami thurai kim kowi dow masiuüa hai kachakuüa mih akawmma chekhai. Filistinuüa kowh aluchowuüa maten paw nakowi uowi bowk chekhai. Kimluk hownia Simsawn kowh tamasa mük miuüa paw masiuüa hai kachakuüa 3,000 ia ngia chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tut-e Simsawn awr lü mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, sakrauma hown tuak ang diah. Aw Thurai, sakrauma hown pe ang kür akatchow diah. Nahanow lai ang mik mih Filistinuüa kowi ang nasat pe aklai kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Now Simsawn dow aia iowngra re-e kowh thurai chup kim kowi kowh achüng pre buk mih kowi hawmlawm pra lowk, lakuai pra lowk dowkah khai. Now aia dow nami kimchüng pre buk mih nawtah khai. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Aia dow hek se tek mih, “Filistinuüa hown ang paw pacham tawi kowng lah!” pakhai. Nahanow aia dow aia kowh kür maten hown kimchüng pre buk mih nawtah khai. Now nami thurai chup kim dow aluchowuüa hai kim lak kowi uowi mih Filistinuüa luk kowi uang iu tim rum khai. Naiawng hai aia sing uowi khe kowh lak-e aia kowng mih khin khe Simsawn mih Filistinuüa kowi lang ia kowngla hu khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Nami kung kowi dow atainau-uüa hai a-pa kimchakuüa mih Simsawn uak uang paw büah khai. Now aia uak dow a-pa Manoa kowh tadupra kowi dupah büah khai. Nami tadupra dow Zora hai Estaawl marow takra kowi chekhai. Simsawn dow pirmi ning mowr Israeluüa kowi kruitownla khai.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Mika kowh arup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi Mika pami maru uowi lowk ia. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Nami Mika tek pe a-u mih, “Au, en kowh tai 1,100 iun maru kuta en mih rakowi en cham pe piati mih ang ta. Nami tai dow ang taih paw; nami tai dow ang tut-e uowi reng,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Nakhowk khe Mika kowi a-u tek pe mih, “Pa, en taphuang khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG pacham pe en prasi lah,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Now nami tai 1,100 iun mih dow a-u kowi Mika plan peta khai iawk. Nakhowk khe a-u tek pe mih, “Mami tai hown en naia thawpla arup lowk kownkow CHAKRAMANG vüi ang apta khowk. Naiawng rakowi mami tai mih ang plan peta en iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Now nami tai maten mih a-u kowi Mika plan peta khai. Now Mika u mih nami tai hownia pawah 200 iun hanow nathawpla arup kownkow tai hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa kowi peah khai. Now nami sarauüa mih nami tai hown sawnla arup khai. Nami arup dow Mika kim kowi towah khai.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Mika kowh dow aia kowh thuraiuüa chupra kim uowi lowk chekhai. Aia dow uamowuüa khupah mih ephawd kowrmow lowk hai chili chalachow mih arup sangrum thawpah khai. Now aia kowh chapa lowk ia kowi uamow rah aia peah khai. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Nami khin khe dow Israeluüa kowh mih mang uowi dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow chowlowkkow sak nau iawng chang büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Nami khin khe Judauüa süng kowi kowh Bethlehem marow pami kowi Levi chenchap klanguüa uowi lowk ia. Aia dow Juda krungchakuüa hown tawi taiua uowi khai. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Aia dow akeng kowi nacham uowi kownkow Bethlehem marow hownia lawt khai. Now tiama rawng kowi Efraim krungchakuüa uowi rah hungma mawngma süng kowi Mika kim kowi kowpün khai.<verse eid="JDG 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Nakhowk khe nami Levi klanguüa kowi Mika lüntaah mih, “Tawng hownia chow en uang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Now Levi klanguüa klangah mih, “Ang dow Judauüa süng kowi kowh Bethlehem marow kowi uowi mih Levi chenchap chekhai. Ka rah kowi cham uowi kownkow ang krawi cham uowi rah mih chaw,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10-11" />Nakhowk khe Mika tek pe mih, “Naiawng now ang tut tawi uowi snow. Ang kowh pa iawng hai ang kowh uamow tawi chowng towbowt. Ang tut-e en tawi uowi now paning kowi tai 10 iun chi ang nape en kown. Nami klen kowi chakkham hai khupdip tawngklai paw ang nape en kown taih,” pakhai. Nami laiklow tata now nami Levi klanguüa mih nauta khai. Mika mih nami Levi klanguüa kowi achapa iawng müla khai. <verse eid="JDG 17:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Nami klanguüa kowi Mika peah uamow rah hownia bowt now nami klanguüa dow Mika kim kowi tawi uowi khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Mika tek mih, “Ang kim kowi Levi chenchap uang chowng uamow lowk ia khowk chedow CHAKRAMANG pe ang prasi kown mih ang tuk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Dan krungchakuüa cham mü süng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa kowh dow mang uowi dowi tak chekhai. Nakhowk khe Dan krungchakuüa dow amatni nauowila kownkow krawi cham süng büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israel chenchap pungmadawng kowi Dan krungchakuüa dow amatni nauowila kown mih süng tawi nowng powng dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh tasen akiakma miuüa kowi ruiah tanga ia khai. Now amatni vüi uowi rah süng nakrawi mü kaneu kownkow <char style="w">dumiow</char> tanga ia kowi Zora hai Esta-Awl marow hownia cham chinah büah khai. Dumiow tanga ia kowi krawi tek pe büah mih, “Tarü büah; krawi mü a-i pren büah madiah,” pakhai. Nahanow nami dumiow tanga ia dow Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowkowi hanow Mika kim re-e kowting büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Nami khin khe amatni dow Mika kim kowi kowh tawi uowi mih Levi klanguüa kowh kraw tün tukta khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Mika kim lak kowi kowkup now nami Levi klanguüa kowi lüntaah mih, “Makowi mia chow uang pawla en? Tawng chow en chang makowi? Tawng rakowi chow makowi en uang?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Nakhowk khe nami klanguüa klangah mih, “Ang vüi Mika chang mih ahuma. Pe ang maina kowh aia tow ang mih chekhai, now ang dow aia kowh uamow chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Now kowbüah plan tek pe iawk mih, “Anging kowh khari kowi chawn kown chünchü sakrauma hown Thurai kowi sam lünta madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Nakhowk khe nami uamow klangah mih, “Thaulangma hown tarü büa diah; CHAKRAMANG mih nakrawi mingkhet enni kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Now nami maru tanga ia dow nami hownia lawt hanow Lais marow kowi kowkowi khai. Amatni dow Sidawnuüa iawng kram uowi dowi hai asowrma hown thaulangma Lais marow chakuüa uowi mih kowkhi büah khai. Lais marowchakuüa dow tawng chap paw khawr dowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi amatni dow Sidawnuüa hown alakma chekhai, now amatni kowi nauang khowngah kown mih maru paw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Now nami maru tanga ia dow Zora hai Esta-Awl marow kowi uang plan khai bowt. Nakhowk khe nami tanga ia kowi amatni kowh maru-uüa hawt lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow enni cham khila?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9-10" />Nakhowk khe kowbüah klangah mih, “Anging kowmüah mih süng dow klangiungma chekhai. Nakowi kowh maru-uüa uowi rah dow aiukma panow thaulangma chekhai. Nakowi dow lusa kowi kowh uanh maten tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi. Nakowi kowting now enni nakhi kown taih. Nami süng dow Thurai peta a-i mih chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi chu, kowbüah kowi kowsen kownkow alenma a-i kowkowi diah sik. A-i uowi phülü e nadowi bowt tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 18:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Nami laiklow tata now Dan krungchakuüa mih maru iun 600 ia tasen müa rutchün khawkleng pawla now Zora hai Esta-Awl marow hownia tarü khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Amatni dow tiama rawng kowi Judauüa kowh süng kowi Kiriat-Jearim marow re-e kowkhup tangbung khai. Naiawng rakowi Kiriat-Jearim marow satkup pra kowh süng dow kawmat pat Mahane-Dan pahai chap pe ming khai. (Mahane-Dan pami dow “Dan kowh tangbung khup rah” pami chekhai). <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Nami hownia lawt büah hanow amatni dow Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowkup khai, now Mika kim kowi kowpün büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danuüa pawta pe Mika kowh arup hai uamow mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Nakowi uowi büah khe kowkumü Lais marow mih maru tanga ia dow akeng miuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Mami kim kowi kowh towklak lowk mih kowi ephawd kowrmow lowk, chili chalachow mih arup sangrum, now tai hown kowh sowah mih arup lowk uowi mih enni tuk tak bow? Kawmat tawng chow enni achang takla mih sam tuak büah madiah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Nami laiklow tata now amatni dow Levi klanguüa towklak kowi kowkup khai, now aiung angak satang tapaw büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Dan krungchak hownia kowh maru iun 600 ia miuüa dow amatni kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng hailawm Mika kimplawt kowi kowiowng khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Nakhowk khe kowrik paw pren satang mih maru tanga ia miuüa dow towklak kowi kowkupah now tai hown kowh sowah mih arup, ephawd kowrmow hai chili chalachow mih arup maten kowpaw büah khai. Nami khin khe uamow paw maru 600 ia miuüa ria kowi tawi uowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Now naiawngün maru-uüa mih Mika kim kowi kowh towklak lowk mih hownia naiawngün uanh uang lawtla khai. Nakhowk khe nami uamow tek pe mih, “Tawng chow naiawngün enni chang?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Nakhowk khe kowbüah klangah mih, “Hang pawpan. En kowh nawr kowpta phülü. Anging hown phai uang tawi chaw, now anging kowh pa iawng hai anging kowh uamow phai uang tawi chowng chaw. Pakimchakchow vüi kowi kowh uamow lak-e Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh pachen vüi chowng uamow mih lang iung nadowi chow?” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Nami laiklow tata now nami uamow mih lainowmma awmrawm khai. Now ephawd kowrmow, chili chalachow mih arup hai tai hown kowh sowah mih arup ün pawla now Dan krungchakuüa hown tawi tarü khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Now naiawngün maru-uüa mih amatni kowh chauüa, tawncher hai amatni kowh akeng mih uanh maten amatni pur kowi towah now Mika kim hownia mang büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Mika kim hownia lawt büah hanow cham ting sangrum khe Mika kowh kimping namkhetuüa mih uang takua talawm khai. Now amatni dow Dan krungchakuüa kowi kowkawi krawi khai, now Dan krungchakuüa kowi kowkrawi krum büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Amatni dow Dan krungchakuüa kung hownia krawi hek krawi pla büah khai. Nakhowk khe Dan krungchakuüa mih amatni kung prakowi taplan hanow Mika kowi tek pe mih, “Tawng chow en own? Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng khowt mih maru kawm kowi en uang tuk kuala khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Nakhowk khe Mika klangah mih, “Ang kowh uamow hai ang thawpah mih <char style="w">arup aren</char> maten enni pawla ang bowk kung kowi tawng chow ang kowh ta uowi tak? ‘Tawng chow en own?’ pami tawng enni tuk lünta ang khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Nakhowk khe Dan krungchakuüa tek pe mih, “Hang pawpan tham bowt. Mami re-e kunma ngakma mih maru uowi sangrum chaw. En kowh laiklow ta büah hanow nadowk enni tasen khe en hai en kowh kimchakuüa nakowng ni,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Naiawng tekla pe hanow Dan krungchakuüa dow amatni nau kowiah prakowi tarü khai. Now Mika dow aia lak-e Dan krungchakuüa lang kür mih khita hanow aia kim prakowi plan mang khai.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lais marow kowi Danuüa senah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Mika kowh arup maten hai uamow kowi pawla now Dan krungchakuüa dow Lais marow kowi kowkowi khai. Amatni dow nakowi kowh asowrma hai athaulangma uowi miuüa kowi kowsenah now kowngta büah bowk khai. Now nami marow dow towkta büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Lais marowchakuüa kowi dow nauang lawngah kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh marow dow Sidawn marow hownia alakma chekhai, now akeng miuüa hown paw amatni kowh dow tatukra uowi dowi chekhai. Amatni kowh marow uowi mih dow Bet-Rehawb marow re-e kowh lawngrawi kowi chekhai. Akung kowi nami marow dow Dan krungchakuüa ta thawpah iawk hanow ta uowiah büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Auown khe dow nami marow ming mih Lais chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow amatni kowh pipu-uüa ming iawng nami marow ming mih Dan pahai ta chap pe büah khai. Dan dow Jakawb kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Dan krungchakuüa dow nami marow kowi amatni vüi nami arup towah khai. Nar kowi cham takhang büah dowi mowr dow Dan krungchakuüa kowh uamow mih Jonathan hai aia kowh krungchakuüa chekhai. Jonathan dow Gersawn krungchak chekhai, now Gersawn dow Mosi kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Silo marow kowi Thurai kim uowi mowr dow Dan krungchakuüa mih tai hown kowh Mika sowah mih arup kowi chupiia khai.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Levi chenchap maru lowk ia changla masi mih narma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa kowh dow mang uowi dowi tak chekhai. Nakhowk khe Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi Levi chenchap maru uowi lowk ia. Now aia kowh dow masi uowi pre ma chekhai. Amasi sawi dow Judauüa uowi rah Bethlehem marow hownia kowh chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Akung kowi aia changla masi mih narma dow chang iang hanow a-pa kim kowi kowpowt khai. Nami masiuüa pa kowh kim dow Judauüa uowi rah Bethlehem marow kowi chekhai. Now aia dow nakowi kowuowi tali la khai. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Now ahua dow amasi sawi kowi kowdepah hanow nauang pawla kownkow kowkowi khai. Aia dow aia kowh nar lowk ia hai aia kowh kawrngaramchük pawla pachum khai. Now amasi kim kowi kowting hanow amasi dow aia kowi mih a-pa kim kowi pawla khai. Now a-pa dow amawkchow kowi khita hanow lainowmma awmrawm khai. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Now a-pu dow nakowi nauowi tak kownkow amawkchow kowi townah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow a-pu kim kowi uowila sum ni khai. Aia dow a-pu hown taiua cha taiua kham khai.<verse eid="JDG 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Now tali ni mih ni khe dow namang bowt kownkow rau-e murpa awr rü hanow chang kamrüt büah khai. Nachenganchepaw a-pu tek pe mih, “Chala khamla prowng diah. Nami kung kowi mang büah iang,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Naiawng rakowi amatchi pu mawk dow chowm hanow taiua cha taiua kham iüah khai. Nakhowk khe a-pu tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown aiak dow iak diah towbowt, now piaw diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Nami maru dow mang kown mih kamrüt changta khowk chepaw a-pu townah rengreng rakowi nami iak paw plan uowi khai iawk. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Now tanga ni mih ni khe paw namang bowt kownkow rau-e murpa awr rü hanow chang kamrüt büah khai. Nachenganchepaw a-pu plan tek pe iawk mih, “Chala khamla prowng diah. Kaw sat kowi prakowi mangah taih,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi pu mawk dow chowm hanow taiua cha taiua kham iüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Now nami maru dow aia changla masi mih narma hai aia kowh nar kowi pawla now namang bowt kownkow chang kamrüt khai. Nakhowk khe a-pu tek pe mih, “Sünta diah, kawmat dow sat kup khowk. Now iiu paw uang iiu iawlaw khowk. Naiawng rakowi aiak dow iak diah towbowt, now piaw diah. Tharau murpa awr rü now kim prakowi mur mangah büah towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10-11" />Nachenganchepaw nami iak dow nakowi iak kown mih mapaw aia nau dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia dau pe uan mih kawrngaramchük pre pum, now aia changla masi mih narma hai aia kowh nar kowi pawla hanow mang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 19:10-11">Now Jebus marow hown atawnchow re-e amatni uang ting khe dow sat kowi khai bowt. (Jebus marow dow Jerusalem marow chekhai). Nakhowk khe anar tek pe kim iah mih, “Chu, mami Jebus marow kowi a-i iak towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 19:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Nachenganchepaw kim iah tek pe mih, “Israeluüa kowh marow nadowi mih kowi a-i kowiak kown nadowi. Gibeah marow kowi phai a-i kowkowi diah sik,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Kim iah plan tek pe anar mih, “Chu, Gibeah marow kowi chepaw, Rama marow kowi chepaw ting pat a-i mang diah sik. Nami pre buk mih marow kowi lowra mih kowi a-i iak kown,” pape khai. <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow mang rengreng chekhai. Now Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh süng kowi kowh Gibeah marow re-e uang ting khe dow sat kup khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Now amatni dow nakowi naiak kownkow nami marow lak kowi kowkowi khai, now marow dawnglang kowi kowchowm büah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi mih kim kowi naiak kown mih miapaw hawah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Nami ni sat kup khe kachakuüa lawngtang lowk ia mih laih hownia uang mang lup chang hanow Gibeah marow kowi uang kup khai. Aia kowh kim ching dow Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia uowi mih dow Gibeah marow kowi chekhai. Nami Gibeah marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow Benjamin krungchakuüa kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Now marow dawnglang kowi nami khari kowi miuüa kowi khita hanow lawngtang lüntaah mih, “Tawng kowi chow enni cham kowi kown? Tawng hownia chow enni uang?” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Nami khari kowi miuüa tek pe mih, “Anging dow Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai. Judauüa süng kowi kowh Bethlehem marow kowi anging kowkowi mih chowdiah. Kawmat dow Efraimuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi anging plan iawk mih chowbowt. Nachenganchepaw anging nacham iak kownkow miapaw haw anging dowi. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Anging tut-e anging kowh kawrngaramchük vüi paw chahau hai pakdi uowi. Now ang vüi hailawm ang masi vüi hai ang kowh nar vüi paw kawmpah hai grep tui uowi chow. Anging vüi tawngpaw lakke dowi bowt tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Nakhowk khe nami lawngtang tek pe mih, “En tut-e thaulangra pacham uowi lah. En lakke mih maten ang nape en kown taih. Nachenganchepaw viadawng kowi dow mapaw hangkow iak büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Naiawng tek pe hanow nami lawngtang mih amatni kowi aia kim kowi pawla khai. Now amatni kowh kawrngaramchük kowi dow pe chaah chakkham khai. Now amatni dow sau bawng sau pang hanow cha büah kham büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gibiauüa kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Naiawng hai amatni mih asowrma uowi büah khai. Nakhowk khe marow kowi kowh maru ngakuüa uang pre sum ia hanow kim mih uang rumta lut büah khai. Now nami maru ngakuüa mih uang khik kimbüng se lawngtang kowi tek pe mih, “En kim kowi kowh uang mih kachakuüa kowi uang lawtla diah. Aia hown anging taphua taiua kown,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Nakhowk khe kim iah dow uang lawt hanow tek pe amatni mih, “Tainau-uüa low, naiawng mih lup ngak hang chang büa diah. Sakrauma hown naiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup hang chang büa diah. Mami maru dow ang kowh pinsüa chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Ang kim kowi kachakuüa hown katpaw taphua taiua dowi tak mih ang kowh chama hai nami maru changla masi mih narma uowi. Kowiüah kowi ang nauang lawtla enni kown towbowt. Kowiüah hown phai taphua taiua büa diah, now enni nau iawng changah büah taih. Nachenganchepaw mami maru kowi dow naiawng mih lup ngak hangkow chang büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün maru-uüa dow lawngtang laiklow mih sünta pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi lawngtang kim kowi kowh nami Levi chenchap maru lowk ia dow aia changla masi mih narma kowi uang awr lawtta pe hüah khai. Now amatni dow uar prowt nami masiuüa kowi lowk ia lowk ia chowchi taleah lütlüt kür hown phuaah iuaah khai. Nami kung kowi dow uar thowi dowi rawn aia kowi lawtta büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Now uar thowi khe dow nami masiuüa mih ahua iak pe mih lawngtang kimplawt re-e kowtakuak hüah khai. Aia dow sat lawt dowi mowr nami re-e takuak hüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Now ahua dow rau-e awr rü hanow namang kownkow ho kimbüng khai. Nakhowk khe amasi takuak hüah panow aia kowh rut kimplawt mawm kowi tatang hüah mih ahua khita khai. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Aia tek pe mih, “Awr rü, a-i mang bowt lah,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw amasi dow aia kowi hing klangah dowi bowt chekhai. Now aia dow kawrngaramchük luk kowi amasi uai kowi tangla hanow kim prakowi mang khai bowt.<verse eid="JDG 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Aia dow kim kowi kowting hanow paw saichow lowk khai, now amasi uai kowi mih dungah laipre dung khai. Now naiawngün dung dow Israeluüa uowi rah maten kowi krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Nami khi miuüa tatek mih, “Aigupta pren hownia a-i Israeluüa uang lawt mih ni hownia kawmat mowr kowi naiawng mih lup katpaw phaw dowi tak! Now khi paw katpaw khi dowi tak! Kawmat tawng chow a-i nachangah kown? Nami lawnguan kowi tawng chow achang takla mih tek lowk ia madiah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Benjaminuüa kowi nasenah kownkow Israeluüa kamrüt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Nami kung kowi dow tawngphak pra kowh Danuüa süng hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Ber-Seba marow mowr hai satlawt pra kowh Gileaduüa süng hownia Israeluüa maten takrüpah hanow Mizpa kowi uang büah khai, now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi takua talawm büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Naiawng takua talawm miuüa dow tasen kiakma mih siphai nget 400,000 ia chekhai. Nami klen kowi Israel krungchak maten hownia kowh aluchowuüa paw tawi uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Mizpa kowi takua talawm büah khe amatni dow naiawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup tawng iawng chow phaw mih talünta büah khai. (Naiawng Israeluüa takua talawm mih satang dow Benjamin krungchakuüa tata khai).<verse eid="JDG 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Nakhowk khe Benjamin krungchakuüa kowngta mih masiuüa kowh hua tek mih, “Ang hai ang changla masi mih narma angching naiakla kownkow Benjaminuüa süng kowi kowh Gibeah marow kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Nami iak Gibeah marowchakuüa uangah now angching pünah mih kim kowi uang umta lut khai, now uang chet ang khai. Amatni dow nasaita ang kown nau mih chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw nasaita ang kown mih takcha ang masi kowi pawla now kür hown phuaah iuaah büah khai. Naiawng changah büah rakowi ang masi mih kowng khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Naiawng rakowi ang masi uak ang dungta naknak now Israel kowi kowh akeng mih krungchakuüa maten kowi adung chi ang krawi saah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi naiawng chang lup ngak mih hai naiawng khowt sangching khawm mih ang pe tukla enni kown ang nau. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Aw Israeluüa, kawmat mih nami lawnguan kowi talawp talai büa diah, now Gibeahuüa luk kowi tawng chow achang takla mih tek büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Nakhowk khe maru maten awr rüah now tek mih, “Kim kowi miapaw a-i namang kown nadowi; a-i pungmadawng hownia lowk iachow paw naplan kown nadowi. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Gibeahuüa kowi amia chow nakowsen kown mih a-i nakuak pe plang kown. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Israel krungchak maten hownia maru iun 100 ia kowi 10 ia chi, 1,000 ia kowi 100 ia chi, now 10,000 ia kowi 1,000 ia chi narui maru kown, now naiawngün ruiah miuüa mih siphaiuüa vüi nakowpaw chakkham kown. Now a-i ta lat mih maten dow Benjaminuüa süng kowi kowh Gibeah marow kowi kowkowiah now Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang miuüa kowi tating tataing mih <char style="w">ripra</char> nakowpeah kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa maten mih takrüpah hanow Gibeahuüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow takua talawm khai.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Amatni dow Benjaminuüa süng kowi kowh arah maten kowi krawi chin maru now krawi lünta mih, “Tawng naiawng suiiai kaniaima mih lup enni tuk chang khai? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Gibeah marow kowi kowh maru ngakuüa maten kowi anging rut kowi ap anging diah. Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia naiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup namitla kownkow amatni kowi anging nasaita bowk kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:13">Nachenganchepaw Benjaminuüa mih amatni kowh tainau-uüa laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Amatni dow Israeluüa hown natasen kownkow marow maten hownia uang lawtah now Gibeah marow kowi uang takua talawm büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Nami ni khe amatni dow marow towng hownia 26,000 ia siphaiuüa kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Nami klen kowi Gibeah marow kowi kowh lang kloah mih siphaiuüa paw tawi uowi 700 ia chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Naiawngün 700 ia mih siphaiuüa dow lakuai rut hown iaiba ap kiakma chekhai. Amatni dow sam paiangchow kowi khowm padow iaiba hown ia manh chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Now akeng pra kowh Israel siphaiuüa dow bowkbowk kowi 400,000 ia chekhai. Amatni dow tasen akiakma chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Israeluüa dow Bethel marow kowi kowkowiah now Benjaminuüa hown tasen kownkow mia chen chow narik tarü kown mih Thurai tut-e kowlünta khai. Now CHAKRAMANG mih Juda krungchakuüa narik tarü kown padow klangah khai.<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Israeluüa mih auai rau awr rü hanow Gibeah marow re-e kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow Benjaminuüa hown natasen kownkow lawt büah hanow amatni kowh siphai hawmh kowi krawi towah khai.<verse eid="JDG 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa hown Benjaminuüa tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Nakhowk khe Benjaminuüa dow Gibeah marow hownia uang lawtah now Israeluüa hown uang tasen khai. Nami ni khe amatni dow Israeluüa kowh siphai 22,000 ia kowi saita büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22-23" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa dow sat kup dowi mowr CHAKRAMANG tut-e nguk büah kar büah khai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh tainau Benjaminuüa kowi anging kowsen iawk kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:22-23">Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Ow, kowsen büah iawk diah,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Israel siphaiuüa dow nakowdowk tasen iawk kownkow sakkraingma hown kowkowi büah hanow amatni rik tasen khe kowh arah re-e kamrüt büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 20:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Now auai ni khe amatni dow Benjamin krungchakuüa hown kowtasen khai iawk. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Nakhowk khe Benjaminuüa paw Gibeah marow hownia uang lawt hanow Israeluüa hown uang tasen khai. Nakow leng paw Benjaminuüa mih Israel siphai 18,000 ia kowi saita khai iawk. Naiawngün siphai hawmh dow saidawng hown kowh tasen akiakma miuüa kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa maten mih Bethel marow kowi kowkowiah now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowkar büah khai. Nakow ni khe amatni dow sat kup dowi mowr <char style="w">khang hawm</char> büah khai, now CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap chang büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27-28" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh naukrang natuk büah kown nau kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi lüntaah büah mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh tainau Benjaminuüa kowi anging nakowsen iawk kown bow?” pakhai. Now CHAKRAMANG klangah mih, “Ow, kowsen büah iawk diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tharau dow Benjaminuüa kowi enni rut kowi ang naap enni kown chekhai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:27-28">Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</char> uowi mih dow Bethel marow kowi chekhai. Now nakhowk khe kowh chang uamow lup mih dow Eleazar kowh chapa Finehas chekhai. Eleazar dow Arawn kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 20:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa dow Gibeah marow tapat lut krawi ku tow siphai khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Now sum ni kowh ni dow Benjaminuüa hown natadowk tasen iawk kownkow kowrik tasen büah khe kowh iawng Gibeah marow re-e chowlowkkow uowi rah kowi kowkrawi uowi büah khai iawk. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Nami khin khe paw Israeluüa kowi nauang senah iawk kownkow Benjaminuüa mih Gibeah marow hownia uang lawt hanow marow hownia alak sangrum mowr uang büah khai. Amatni dow rik tasen khe kowh iawng Israeluüa kowi saiah khai. Amatni dow dowm kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi hai Bethel marow pra kowh tiama kowi uowi miuüa hown Gibeah marow pra kowh tiama kowi uowi miuüa hailawm bowkbowk kowi maru iun 30 ia ngia krawi saita büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Naiawng rakowi Benjaminuüa tatek mih, “A-i rik senah khe kowh iawng amatni kowi a-i nowngta iawk mih chowbowt,” pakhai. Israeluüa dow tatek mih, “Chu, kung prakowi a-i chang powt iow hanow kowbüah kowi marow hownia rasa prakowi a-i pawla lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Now nami hownia Israel siphaiuüa dow chang powt iow khai bowt, now Bal-Tamar pami arah kowi nahawt dowkah tasen kownkow kamrüt büah khai. Now Gibeah marow satkup pra kowh tapet mih Israeluüa dow Benjaminuüa kowi nasenah kownkow amatni tapetra hownia uang lawt khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Nakhowk khe mih Israeluüa hownia kowh kloah mih maru iun 10,000 ia mih dow Gibeah marow prakowi kowkowiah now kowsenah khai. Nami khin khe amatni dow tasen chamang tasen büah khai. Nachenganchepaw Benjaminuüa dow amatni napiak kown chowbowt mih tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Nami ni dow Israeluüa rut kowi Benjaminuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG pe sumah khai. Nakow ni dow Benjaminuüa kowh maru iun 25,100 ia kowi Israeluüa saita pe khai. Naiawngün kowng mih Benjamin kowh siphaiuüa dow saidawng hown tasen akiakma mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni sum mih chowbowt pami Benjaminuüa tukta khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Benjaminuüa pur hownia Israeluüa chang powt iow mih dow Gibeah marow re-e kowh tapet mih siphaiuüa kowi owmsak rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Naiawng tapet mih siphaiuüa dow Gibeah marow kowi mingmang dowi khe kowkup rui khai, now marow kowi krawi tauet büah plawt hanow nakowi kowh maru maten kowi krawi saita bowk büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38-39" />Naiawng tapet mih siphaiuüa hown akeng mih Israel siphaiuüa dow rik towla amatra lowk khai. Amatni tatek mih, “Tapet mih siphaiuüa mih marow kowi kowkup hanow nakrawi towk marow kown. Now marow hownia uangnim iawng maikhük pün lawmlawm mih khita khe dow chang powt iow miuüa nauai taplan hanow Benjaminuüa kowi nasenah kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:38-39">Benjamin siphaiuüa dow Israel siphai 30 ia kowi ia saita now tatek mih, “A-i rik tasen khe kowh iawng khaleng paw Israel siphaiuüa kowi a-i nowngta iawk mih chowbowt ba,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh marow hownia maikhük chai lawmlawm khe dow marow prakowi haimü büah pache marow hownia maikhük pün lawmlawm mih khita büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Nami khin khe dow Israel siphaiuüa mih amatni prakowi uai taplan khai bowt. Nakhowk khe dow Benjamin siphaiuüa mih lainowmma kram khai. Amatni dow amatni luk kowi sum khing uang ting mih chowbowt pami tuk büah khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Israel siphaiuüa pur hownia süngrüp süngkangma prakowi powt khai. Nachenganchepaw tasenra hownia amatni dow plai dowi chekhai. Marow ün hownia Benjaminuüa uang lawt hanow amatni kowi dow nami re-e Israeluüa saiah khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Israeluüa dow Benjaminuüa kowi umta lut khai, now Gibeah marow satlawt pra mowr amatni kowi kawikrawiah hanow tiama rawng kowi krawi saita bowk khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Naiawng hai Benjamin siphaiuüa dow 18,000 ia kowng khai. Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow tasen akiakma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Now süngrüp süngkangma hownia taplan now Rimawn pami huamang prakowi powt mih akeng mih Benjamin siphaiuüa kowi dow powt thüm khe tiama rawng kowi 5,000 ia Israel siphaiuüa saiah khai. Nami kung kowi paw Israel siphaiuüa dow Gidawm marow mowr Benjamin siphaiuüa kowi kawikrawiah khai, now maru iun 2,000 ia kowi krawi plan saita büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Nakow ni khe Benjamin siphaiuüa kowng mih dow bowkbowk kowi 25,000 ia chekhai. Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow tasen akiakma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Nachenganchepaw Benjamin siphai 600 ia dow süngrüp süngkangma hownia taplan hanow Rimawn huamang kowi kownowng powt khai. Now ia powt mih Benjamin siphaiuüa dow tali la mowr nami Rimawn huamang kowi hing uowi khai. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Nami khin khe Israel siphaiuüa mih kowplan hanow Benjaminuüa kowh marow maten kowi kowkrawi kup khai, now ta sing uowi mih Benjaminuüa maten kowi hai tawncher maten kowi krawi saita bowk khai. Nami klen kowi amatni krawi kupah mih marow maten dow hing towkla büah bowk khai.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Benjamin krungchakuüa kowi Israeluüa peah masi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Benjamin krungchakuüa hown tasen dowi rawn Israeluüa mih Mizpa pami arah kowi takua talawm khai. Nakhowk khe Benjamin krungchakuüa kowi amatni napeah chama dowi kownkow takham büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2-3" />Nachenganchepaw tasen kung kowi dow Bethel marow kowi amatni kowkowi khai, now sat kup dowi mowr CHAKRAMANG pur kowi atün atünma kowkar büah khai. Amatni tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai, Israeluüa luk kowi tawngplawng kowchow maiawng en tuk pe phawah khai? Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia tawngplawng kowchow krungchak taküm dowi lowk?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 21:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Now amatni dow auai rau murpa awr rü hanow thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Now tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap chang büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Amatni dow lowkkowlowk talünta büah mih, “Israel krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi Mizpa kowi kowh uang tawi dowi mih uowi ne bow?” pabüah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Mizpa kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uang tawi dowi mih kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown pahai Mizpa kowi takham büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Amatni dow amatni kowh tainau Benjamin krungchakuüa vüi sak nga khai. Amatni tek mih, “Israel krungchakuüa pungmadawng hownia ani dow krungchak takhuowi lowk khowk. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Ta sing uowi mih Benjamin krungchakuüa kowi tawng iawng chow a-i cham ka pe masi kown? A-i kowh chamauüa kowi dow amatni hown a-i pe tachawngah kown nadowi padow CHAKRAMANG ming hown a-i takhamta khowk,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Amatni dow lowkkowlowk talünta büah mih, “Israel krungchak pungmadawng hownia Mizpa kowi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi uang tawi dowi mih uowi ne bow?” pakhai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Jabes-Gilead hownia miapaw uang tawi dowi mih tukta büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni rüa maru iun mih khin khe Jabes-Gilead hownia kowh maru-uüa kowi lowk iachow paw khila büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10-11" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow amatni kowh akürma mih siphai hawmh pungmadawng hownia 12,000 ia kowi Jabes-Gilead kowi kowchinah khai. Naiawngünuüa kowi krawi tek pe büah mih, “Katpaw taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa hawmh klen kowi dow aiuk asowm, masiuüa kachakuüa uowi mih srui kowi saila büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JDG 21:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Now siphai hawmh dow Jabes-Gilead kowi kowh katpaw taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa kowi kala 400 ia khai. Now naiawngün malauüa hawmh kowi dow Kanan pren kowi kowh Silo marow kowi tangbung khup rah kowi uang pawla büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Rimawn huamang kowi Benjamin krungchakuüa tut-e kowchin maru khai. Nahanow amatni dow Benjamin krungchakuüa hown kowtalawp khai, now taking tasangra laiklow phuang büah khai. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Now Benjamin krungchakuüa mih Rimawn huamang hownia plan khai bowt. Now akeng mih Israeluüa dow Jabes-Gilead hownia kowh towah sing mih masiuüa hawmh hown amatni kowi pe tachawngah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni bowkbowk vüi masiuüa takhowm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Israeluüa dow Benjamin krungchakuüa vüi sak nga khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israel krungchakuüa kowh takrüpra dow CHAKRAMANG piakta pe khai. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Naiawng rakowi Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa tek mih, “Benjamin krungchak kowi kowh masiuüa hawmh kowi dow a-i kowngta bowk khowk chekhai. Kawmat kowh ta sing uowi mih kachakuüa hawmh kowi tawng kowi chow a-i cham ka pe masi kown? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia pachen mih natama dowi kownkow ta sing uowi mih Benjamin krungchak kowi nalawngah kown takla. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Nachenganchepaw a-i kowh chamauüa kowi dow amatni kowi a-i ia pe dowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Benjamin krungchakuüa kowi peah chama mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah pami a-i takhamta lai khowk chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Nami kung kowi amatni tek mih, “Silo marow kowi ning towng CHAKRAMANG vüi pawi phaw reng,” pabüah khai. Silo marow dow Bethel marow hownia tawngphak pra kowi, Lebona marow hownia mrawkphak pra kowi, now Bethel marow hownia Sekem marow kowi mangla mih tiama satlawt prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Amatni tek pe Benjamin krungchakuüa mih, “Silo kowi kowkowi büah now grep krum kowi kowhawt tapet büa diah, now hawt tang müah büa diah. <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />Silo kowi kowh malauüa hawmh uang dowm plai khowk hanow grep krum hownia enni nalawt kown. Now enni nauah mih kowi nakhümla lowk ia chi hanow Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh süng kowi enni napawla kown. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh kowh pa chepaw, arakuüa chepaw nauang chawk lai kownkow anging tut-e nauang kown. Nakhowk khe maiawng anging hawt tek pe kown, ‘Anging kowi tuakla se Benjamin krungchakuüa kowi saksing sanaah büa diah; enni kowh chamauüa kowi amatni kowi hing peta diah towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tasenra hownia paw amatni takhowm iawng a-i uang kala pe masi dowi chekhai. Enni pe pawah mih nadowi kowi amatni uang pawah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni luk kowi aprek nauowi kown nadowi,’ pabüah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Naiawng rakowi Benjamin krungchakuüa dow naiawng chang khai. Amatni dow malauüa hawmh plai mih khin khe amatni chowlowkkow vüi khümla lowk ia chi hanow pawla büah khai. Now amatni kowh krawng bawn kowi kowplan büah hanow amatni kowh marow hai kua mih kowplan thawpah büah khai. Now nakowi mih uowi büah khai bowt. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih nami hownia amatni chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn kowi mang büah khai bowt.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa kowh dow mang uowi dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow chowlowkkow sak nau iawng chang büah khai.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>